1
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:32,810
A little pause... and we are back.

2
00:00:55,130 --> 00:01:03,130
A little pause... and we are back.

3
00:01:38,030 --> 00:01:39,030
What?

4
00:01:39,070 --> 00:01:40,390
What does this mean?

5
00:01:40,391 --> 00:01:41,870
A man?

6
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:43,370
A person?

7
00:01:45,570 --> 00:01:46,570
Oh no!

8
00:01:46,630 --> 00:01:48,130
This is a summoning jutsu!

9
00:01:48,310 --> 00:01:48,910
Naruto!

10
00:01:49,150 --> 00:01:49,670
Sakura!

11
00:01:49,850 --> 00:01:50,110
Quick!

12
00:01:50,190 --> 00:01:51,190
Get rid of the scrolls!

13
00:02:00,630 --> 00:02:01,230
What?

14
00:02:01,231 --> 00:02:02,231
It's you?

15
00:02:06,850 --> 00:02:07,850
Hey.

16
00:02:09,030 --> 00:02:10,370
Long time no see.

17
00:02:10,371 --> 00:02:11,371
Long time no see, huh?

18
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:13,430
Congratulations!

19
00:02:14,110 --> 00:02:15,470
You passed the second exam!

20
00:02:17,490 --> 00:02:22,310
To celebrate your passing, I would love to
treat you all to some Ichiraku ramen,

21
00:02:22,610 --> 00:02:23,510
but I... Ramen?

22
00:02:24,070 --> 00:02:24,590
Seriously?

23
00:02:25,010 --> 00:02:26,050
That's so cool!

24
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:26,590
Wait!

25
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:27,910
I'm not done!

26
00:02:28,130 --> 00:02:28,850
So cool!

27
00:02:28,910 --> 00:02:29,250
Let go!

28
00:02:29,570 --> 00:02:30,570
Hey, Naruto!

29
00:02:30,970 --> 00:02:31,970
Oh yeah!

30
00:02:32,390 --> 00:02:33,810
Ramen would be awesome!

31
00:02:34,590 --> 00:02:38,430
Especially after all the bugs and plants
we've had to eat for the past two days!

32
00:02:38,830 --> 00:02:39,630
So great!

33
00:02:39,750 --> 00:02:39,910
Yeah!

34
00:02:40,370 --> 00:02:41,870
I'm gonna eat every noodle ever made!

35
00:02:42,150 --> 00:02:43,730
Where does he get all his energy?

36
00:02:44,450 --> 00:02:45,450
Yeah!

37
00:02:46,070 --> 00:02:47,110
Shut up!

38
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:48,590
Alright.

39
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:52,070
Well, I can see you're still as
hyperactive as ever, Naruto.

40
00:02:52,530 --> 00:02:54,170
Oh yeah, Sensei.

41
00:02:54,230 --> 00:02:55,230
Yeah?

42
00:02:55,370 --> 00:02:57,230
What does that writing on the wall mean?

43
00:02:57,390 --> 00:02:59,467
The parchment the
letters are written on is

44
00:02:59,468 --> 00:03:01,690
kinda eaten away, so
it's difficult to read it.

45
00:03:01,795 --> 00:03:02,830
We can't understand it.

46
00:03:03,090 --> 00:03:04,090
Oh please!

47
00:03:04,510 --> 00:03:06,330
Look, we passed, didn't we?

48
00:03:06,490 --> 00:03:08,430
That stuff doesn't matter now!

49
00:03:08,910 --> 00:03:09,430
Well...

50
00:03:09,431 --> 00:03:11,511
Actually, explaining
that is another one of the

51
00:03:11,512 --> 00:03:14,251
duties that I've been
sent here to take care of.

52
00:03:14,390 --> 00:03:15,390
Hm?

53
00:03:15,645 --> 00:03:16,645
What, seriously?

54
00:03:16,890 --> 00:03:17,310
That's right.

55
00:03:17,530 --> 00:03:18,550
It's serious business.

56
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:21,150
Give it a good read.

57
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:25,910
They're instructions Lord Hokage recorded
as principles that Chunin should follow.

58
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,040
They're instructions?

59
00:03:28,230 --> 00:03:28,450
Yes.

60
00:03:28,670 --> 00:03:31,270
Heaven stands for your mind and earth for
your body.

61
00:03:31,370 --> 00:03:35,870
If qualities of heaven are your desire,
acquire wisdom to take your mind higher.

62
00:03:36,070 --> 00:03:36,530
Get it?

63
00:03:37,070 --> 00:03:38,190
Mmm... mm-mm.

64
00:03:38,191 --> 00:03:39,490
Alright, I'll explain.

65
00:03:39,790 --> 00:03:45,590
In other words, if your weakness lies in
your intellect, Naruto, then you have to

66
00:03:45,591 --> 00:03:48,735
make doubly sure that you work
hard to learn all the information

67
00:03:48,736 --> 00:03:51,250
and skills that you need to
prepare for your missions.

68
00:03:52,170 --> 00:03:54,170
Ugh... okay, I get your point.

69
00:03:54,910 --> 00:03:55,910
And you.

70
00:03:56,110 --> 00:03:59,710
If earthly qualities you lack,
train your body, prepare to attack.

71
00:04:00,010 --> 00:04:04,270
So if your weakness lies in your physical
strength, Sakura, then you have to make

72
00:04:04,271 --> 00:04:06,784
sure that you work on
your physical conditioning

73
00:04:06,785 --> 00:04:09,091
every single day so it
improves your ability to fight.

74
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:12,890
When heaven and earth
are open together, the

75
00:04:12,891 --> 00:04:15,430
perilous path will
become righteous forever.

76
00:04:15,830 --> 00:04:19,650
Meaning, if your mind and
body are working together as one,

77
00:04:19,651 --> 00:04:23,110
then even a very dangerous
mission can become an easy one.

78
00:04:23,410 --> 00:04:26,150
So what about that spot with the missing
letter?

79
00:04:27,510 --> 00:04:29,850
Well, that part is meant for all of you to
fill in.

80
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:32,570
Do you see that symbol on the scroll?

81
00:04:33,030 --> 00:04:35,970
It's the character for person,
a reference to you, Chunin.

82
00:04:35,971 --> 00:04:39,458
You see, these five days
of survival were to test your

83
00:04:39,459 --> 00:04:42,270
abilities as Chunin and to
see if you'd be any good at it.

84
00:04:42,370 --> 00:04:45,910
And I gotta say, you guys really did
magnificently.

85
00:04:46,770 --> 00:04:48,810
A Chunin is a leader, a guide.

86
00:04:49,010 --> 00:04:51,514
It's a Chunin's responsibility
to be aware of the

87
00:04:51,515 --> 00:04:54,270
strengths and weaknesses
of those serving under him.

88
00:04:54,470 --> 00:04:57,266
And to know what skills
and training those ninja

89
00:04:57,267 --> 00:04:59,871
are going to need in order
to succeed on a mission.

90
00:04:59,930 --> 00:05:02,512
You did an excellent job
on this mission and I want

91
00:05:02,513 --> 00:05:05,170
you to remember these
instructions on your next one.

92
00:05:07,590 --> 00:05:08,670
Well, that's it.

93
00:05:08,710 --> 00:05:10,770
That was everything I was supposed to say
to you.

94
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:22,220
One more thing.

95
00:05:22,930 --> 00:05:25,960
For the third exam, don't push it too far.

96
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,560
Especially you.

97
00:05:27,780 --> 00:05:29,941
Naruto, I worry... Iruka-sensei!

98
00:05:30,470 --> 00:05:32,780
When I got this headband, I stopped being
a student!

99
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:35,380
So you don't need to worry about me at
all!

100
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,420
Not anymore!

101
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:38,760
Right now!

102
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:43,900
I'm a ninja too!

103
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:49,590
Naruto, you're right.

104
00:05:49,670 --> 00:05:50,730
I'm sorry about that.

105
00:05:54,770 --> 00:05:58,010
Look, I know their strengths and
weaknesses better than anyone else does.

106
00:05:58,410 --> 00:06:01,630
Whatever the result, I want to be the one
who breaks the news to them.

107
00:06:02,410 --> 00:06:04,070
Fine, if you're that hung up on it.

108
00:06:04,130 --> 00:06:06,190
Then I'll just leave that team in your
hands.

109
00:06:07,210 --> 00:06:11,170
But I would have thought you'd have a
little more confidence in them, you know?

110
00:06:11,730 --> 00:06:12,730
Thank you, Anko.

111
00:06:13,890 --> 00:06:16,690
Wait, those guys are Kakashi's students,
aren't they?

112
00:06:17,750 --> 00:06:21,810
Listen, if Kakashi's got faith in them,
then I wouldn't count them out just yet,

113
00:06:21,930 --> 00:06:22,930
Iruka.

114
00:06:30,895 --> 00:06:34,990
It seems to me now that the one who truly
understands the strengths and weaknesses

115
00:06:34,991 --> 00:06:39,150
of these young ninja best might very well
be you, Kakashi.

116
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,680
Ugh...

117
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:47,220
Ugh...

118
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,400
How is it?

119
00:06:50,150 --> 00:06:51,980
Does the curse mark still cause you pain?

120
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:54,020
No, not really.

121
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:55,380
Thanks to you, it's much better.

122
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,480
That's good, but we better get back to
business.

123
00:06:58,580 --> 00:07:02,420
This Orochimaru is one of the Sannin,
the legendary Three Ninja, isn't he?

124
00:07:02,830 --> 00:07:05,530
He's supposed to be so
incredibly powerful that not

125
00:07:05,531 --> 00:07:07,981
even the Anbu Black Ops
unit could bring him down.

126
00:07:08,855 --> 00:07:11,720
I'd heard a rumor that he died,
but I guess that wasn't true.

127
00:07:12,540 --> 00:07:14,680
Why did he come to this village now,
anyway?

128
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,000
He's after Sasuke, right?

129
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,440
What?

130
00:07:19,455 --> 00:07:23,280
Anko, we've confirmed that 21 ninja have
finished the second exam.

131
00:07:25,075 --> 00:07:27,579
And as for the third exam,
according to the rules,

132
00:07:27,629 --> 00:07:30,090
we'll have to hold a
round of preliminaries first.

133
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:32,800
The first time in five years.

134
00:07:34,950 --> 00:07:38,600
Now, for the time being, we'll just
continue with the exams as planned.

135
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:41,900
But I also want to keep an eye on his
movements as well.

136
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,560
Yes.

137
00:07:54,150 --> 00:07:57,850
First of all, congratulations on finishing
the second exam!

138
00:07:59,170 --> 00:07:59,290
Huh.

139
00:07:59,730 --> 00:08:02,170
There were 78 ninja who took that exam.

140
00:08:02,450 --> 00:08:04,890
Frankly, I'm surprised that even 21
passed.

141
00:08:05,270 --> 00:08:07,790
I knew that less than half
would make it, but I really

142
00:08:07,791 --> 00:08:10,071
thought the number
would be in the single digits.

143
00:08:24,645 --> 00:08:25,660
I'm really hungry.

144
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:26,960
What a drag.

145
00:08:26,961 --> 00:08:28,020
There's so many left.

146
00:08:28,630 --> 00:08:29,800
This is such a pain.

147
00:08:32,250 --> 00:08:34,179
Sasuke and his team have passed,
too!

148
00:08:34,959 --> 00:08:36,260
Well, of course they did.

149
00:08:36,859 --> 00:08:39,260
I see your team didn't do too bad,
Kakashi.

150
00:08:39,959 --> 00:08:41,279
They must have gotten real lucky.

151
00:08:41,989 --> 00:08:45,700
Of course, with my team still around,
your team is doomed to failure.

152
00:08:46,259 --> 00:08:48,311
After all, what matters
on the next test is

153
00:08:48,312 --> 00:08:51,001
ability, and we've
got you far outclassed.

154
00:08:51,139 --> 00:08:52,908
Well, I guess that
part of growing up is

155
00:08:52,968 --> 00:08:55,680
learning to deal with
heartbreak, huh, Kakashi?

156
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,000
Hm?

157
00:08:57,909 --> 00:08:58,909
Did you say something?

158
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:07,940
Alright, Kakashi, you win this round.

159
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:10,520
Boy, that drives me nuts when you act so
cool.

160
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:13,100
There's no way I'm gonna let you get the
best of me.

161
00:09:13,895 --> 00:09:16,440
So that's Gai-sensei's old rival,
huh?

162
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:20,900
Well, if I had to judge them on looks
alone, I'd say Gai-sensei would lose.

163
00:09:20,901 --> 00:09:23,720
Gai-sensei is just the coolest teacher
ever!

164
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:26,580
I mean, he is so cool, he practically
glows with cool!

165
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:29,420
You watch, Gai-sensei!

166
00:09:29,780 --> 00:09:31,440
Someday I'll make you proud of me!

167
00:09:32,889 --> 00:09:34,880
Lord Hokage, they're all yours.

168
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,240
Hm.

169
00:09:36,959 --> 00:09:37,959
Very well, then.

170
00:09:38,060 --> 00:09:39,140
Now listen closely.

171
00:09:39,300 --> 00:09:42,620
I'm going to tell you exactly what you'll
all be doing on the third exam.

172
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:45,660
Huh?

173
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:52,040
Lord Hokage, before you do, please allow
me, Hayate Genji... ...Echo to speak first.

174
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:53,960
So be it.

175
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:58,080
There's something I would like all of
you...

176
00:09:59,660 --> 00:10:01,560
...to do before the third exam.

177
00:10:08,020 --> 00:10:13,680
Uh... we have to have a preliminary exam
before we can move on to... the real one.

178
00:10:14,060 --> 00:10:15,060
Huh?

179
00:10:15,860 --> 00:10:16,860
A what?

180
00:10:17,465 --> 00:10:18,100
Preliminary?

181
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,900
Just what do you mean by that?

182
00:10:20,435 --> 00:10:25,420
Uh... well, you see... The first and
second exams might have been too easy.

183
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:29,400
The fact is, we never expected so many of
you to still be here.

184
00:10:30,059 --> 00:10:33,940
According to the rules of the Chunin
exams, a preliminary round can be held at

185
00:10:33,941 --> 00:10:36,840
any stage, in order to reduce the number
of candidates remaining.

186
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,240
But... is that fair?

187
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,400
We have to speed things up a bit.

188
00:10:41,769 --> 00:10:43,600
A lot of important guests will be
watching.

189
00:10:44,219 --> 00:10:45,920
We can't afford to waste their time.

190
00:10:46,804 --> 00:10:48,380
They've come to see only the best.

191
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:52,920
So if there are any of you who feel you're
not in top physical condition,

192
00:10:53,180 --> 00:10:54,580
now's your chance to...

193
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,580
Sorry about that.

194
00:10:57,254 --> 00:10:59,920
As I was saying, any of you who don't feel
up to this...

195
00:11:00,469 --> 00:11:02,280
Now's the time for you to bow out.

196
00:11:03,309 --> 00:11:05,149
The preliminaries will be starting
immediately.

197
00:11:05,689 --> 00:11:06,360
Come on!

198
00:11:06,380 --> 00:11:07,380
You mean right now?

199
00:11:07,420 --> 00:11:10,080
We just finished barely surviving the last
exam!

200
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,240
Don't we get a break?

201
00:11:12,099 --> 00:11:13,280
Man, what a drag.

202
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,900
Eh... when do we eat?

203
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,680
Well, they pulled a fast one.

204
00:11:17,681 --> 00:11:18,681
But I'm in.

205
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,500
All the way.

206
00:11:19,580 --> 00:11:20,440
No matter what.

207
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,520
I gave my word to Kabuto.

208
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:25,640
Okay.

209
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:27,980
You got me.

210
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:29,020
I'm out.

211
00:11:33,580 --> 00:11:35,960
Kabuto Yakushi of the Leaf Village,
right?

212
00:11:36,900 --> 00:11:37,420
Okay.

213
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:39,000
You can go on and step back.

214
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,360
Gotcha.

215
00:11:41,900 --> 00:11:42,420
Kabuto!

216
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:44,040
Hold on a second!

217
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,120
You can't quit!

218
00:11:45,449 --> 00:11:46,420
I don't get this!

219
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,440
What's going on?

220
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:48,680
Oh, Naruto.

221
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:49,920
I'm sorry.

222
00:11:50,884 --> 00:11:52,420
But my body's just too beat up.

223
00:11:53,159 --> 00:11:54,159
I can't hack it.

224
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:59,751
The fact is, ever since orientation and
that dust-up with the Sound Village team.

225
00:11:59,752 --> 00:11:59,980
..

226
00:11:59,981 --> 00:12:02,400
I've had no hearing at all in my left ear.

227
00:12:03,740 --> 00:12:05,900
And now to have to put my life on the
line?

228
00:12:06,684 --> 00:12:07,684
To fight again?

229
00:12:07,829 --> 00:12:08,980
Right away without a break?

230
00:12:09,619 --> 00:12:10,619
I can't do it.

231
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:16,480
Seems to me I've seen that one before.

232
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:18,960
Anko?

233
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,280
Oh, right.

234
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,720
Kabuto Yakushi.

235
00:12:25,380 --> 00:12:28,780
Says here he's... failed six times in a
row.

236
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:31,900
What do you have on his background?

237
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:35,780
His time at the Academy was not what you'd
call impressive.

238
00:12:36,620 --> 00:12:37,620
Average grades.

239
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:41,080
Took him a full three tries before he
passed the graduation exam.

240
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:44,268
As far as the missions
he's carried out since then,

241
00:12:44,269 --> 00:12:46,920
there's been two C ranks
and fourteen D ranks.

242
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:50,040
It's not exactly a battle record to write
home about.

243
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,480
However...

244
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:54,960
Go on.

245
00:12:55,540 --> 00:12:57,140
Do you remember the child?

246
00:12:57,640 --> 00:13:00,760
The one who was found after the Battle of
Kikyo Pass?

247
00:13:01,180 --> 00:13:02,560
The only survivor?

248
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:05,500
I remember the story.

249
00:13:05,820 --> 00:13:09,900
It was said a small boy was found among
the enemy dead on the battlefield.

250
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:14,660
He was found barely alive and brought back
by a Jonin from the medical unit.

251
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:17,040
You're saying this is that boy?

252
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:18,120
Yes.

253
00:13:18,121 --> 00:13:22,201
With you here looking after things, you
don't need me, do you, Lord Orochimaru?

254
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:25,220
Guess I'll just have to save my fun for
later.

255
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,240
Until we meet again, Sasuke.

256
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:29,560
Oh.

257
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:31,420
And you too, of course.

258
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,360
Naruto.

259
00:13:35,780 --> 00:13:36,780
Waves of pain!

260
00:13:37,180 --> 00:13:39,020
They're coming sooner and sooner!

261
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:40,920
Oh no!

262
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,140
I knew it!

263
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:45,040
Sasuke!

264
00:13:45,041 --> 00:13:45,860
Listen to me!

265
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:46,980
You have got to quit!

266
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:48,680
Huh?

267
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:54,601
You've been like this ever since you tangled
with Orochimaru, and it's getting worse!

268
00:13:56,780 --> 00:14:02,260
Please... Please, Sasuke,
quit now before...

269
00:14:03,570 --> 00:14:06,420
I don't know what... I'm scared...

270
00:14:07,620 --> 00:14:11,380
Come on, you know as well as I do,
you're in no condition to keep on fighting!

271
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:12,620
Shut up, Sakura!

272
00:14:12,700 --> 00:14:14,440
You think I'm blind or something?

273
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:16,440
Will you please be quiet?

274
00:14:16,441 --> 00:14:19,140
You think I don't see the suffering you're
going through?

275
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:21,840
That's enough, Sakura.

276
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,240
I'm sorry.

277
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,980
I can't let you do it to yourself.

278
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:27,940
I'm going to tell them about that mark.

279
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,780
Then maybe you'll...

280
00:14:30,989 --> 00:14:33,280
Don't you even think of telling them about
this mark.

281
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:37,240
I don't get what you're trying to prove.

282
00:14:37,589 --> 00:14:40,660
Am I supposed to just stand by and watch
you tear yourself apart?

283
00:14:41,569 --> 00:14:42,940
I can't bear to watch it.

284
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:45,280
Then don't watch, but stay out of it.

285
00:14:47,180 --> 00:14:49,040
This has nothing to do with you.

286
00:14:53,660 --> 00:14:56,860
For me, this is something far more than
just an exam.

287
00:14:57,220 --> 00:15:00,960
Whether I become a Chunin or not means
less than nothing to me.

288
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,700
Am I as strong as I can be?

289
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:09,180
All I want is the answer to that.

290
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:13,040
I can only find out by fighting the
strongest.

291
00:15:13,041 --> 00:15:14,200
The best.

292
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:18,460
And the best of the best... are all here.

293
00:15:23,580 --> 00:15:25,300
This is the path I walk.

294
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:28,140
Not you or anyone can change that.

295
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:30,800
Oh, Sasuke.

296
00:15:32,024 --> 00:15:33,344
Man, you don't know when to quit!

297
00:15:33,500 --> 00:15:35,420
What are you biting your head off for,
you idiot?

298
00:15:36,004 --> 00:15:37,524
It's just because she cares about you!

299
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:38,000
Naruto.

300
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,360
Huh?

301
00:15:40,819 --> 00:15:43,360
You're one of the ones I want to fight the
most.

302
00:15:43,361 --> 00:15:44,361
Huh?

303
00:15:49,859 --> 00:15:51,110
It's just as I feared.

304
00:15:52,239 --> 00:15:53,290
What do we do with him?

305
00:15:54,079 --> 00:15:56,019
We take him out of the
exam, hand him over to

306
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:58,110
Black Ops, and let them
keep him locked up.

307
00:15:58,819 --> 00:16:00,790
We have to keep that seal under control...

308
00:16:00,791 --> 00:16:04,310
Oh, and he's just going to quietly go
along with all of this, huh?

309
00:16:04,550 --> 00:16:05,690
You really think so?

310
00:16:06,370 --> 00:16:07,370
You're forgetting.

311
00:16:07,655 --> 00:16:09,310
He's of the Uchiha clan.

312
00:16:09,939 --> 00:16:11,390
I don't care what the heck he is!

313
00:16:11,450 --> 00:16:13,190
If he stays, he's a danger to everyone!

314
00:16:13,809 --> 00:16:16,230
Allow the boy to continue with the exam
for now.

315
00:16:16,231 --> 00:16:16,510
What?

316
00:16:16,511 --> 00:16:17,591
And we'll see what happens.

317
00:16:17,650 --> 00:16:19,050
But, Lord Hokage...

318
00:16:19,349 --> 00:16:22,821
However, at the first sign of
the curse mark growing or his

319
00:16:22,822 --> 00:16:26,030
power getting out of control,
you will step in and stop it.

320
00:16:26,090 --> 00:16:27,090
Right.

321
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:34,070
All right, then.

322
00:16:34,530 --> 00:16:36,830
We'll now begin the preliminary round.

323
00:16:38,050 --> 00:16:44,230
This round will consist of one-on-one
individual combat at full battle intensity.

324
00:16:44,231 --> 00:16:46,670
This is not an exercise.

325
00:16:47,310 --> 00:16:51,630
There are twenty of you remaining,
so that means we will need ten matches.

326
00:16:52,030 --> 00:16:56,670
The surviving candidates from these ten
matches will advance to the third exam.

327
00:16:57,170 --> 00:16:59,270
As for the rules, there are none.

328
00:16:59,490 --> 00:17:02,620
You will fight until one
dies or concedes defeat, or is

329
00:17:02,621 --> 00:17:05,869
rendered physically incapable
of continuing the contest.

330
00:17:06,230 --> 00:17:08,650
Naturally, those who
are losing are urged to

331
00:17:08,651 --> 00:17:11,170
concede defeat promptly
to avoid a fatal outcome.

332
00:17:11,171 --> 00:17:17,031
Furthermore, as Proctor, I'm given a certain
amount of leeway in judging the matches.

333
00:17:18,810 --> 00:17:21,967
I might occasionally
intervene if a match seems

334
00:17:21,968 --> 00:17:24,609
hopeless, to save as
many lives as possible.

335
00:17:25,010 --> 00:17:28,250
Now it's time to reveal what fate has been
chosen for you.

336
00:17:31,530 --> 00:17:32,530
Open the panel.

337
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:47,040
The names of each pair of opponents are
chosen completely at random.

338
00:17:47,041 --> 00:17:51,860
Before each match, these names will appear
on the display behind me.

339
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:56,240
As there's nothing more to say,
let's begin.

340
00:17:56,660 --> 00:17:59,880
In a moment, the names of the first two
opponents will appear.

341
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:14,800
Hmph.

342
00:18:14,801 --> 00:18:16,800
Didn't waste any time, did they?

343
00:18:17,439 --> 00:18:18,439
Hmph.

344
00:18:20,719 --> 00:18:22,520
I couldn't ask for anything more.

345
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:23,340
No!

346
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:25,560
Why did it have to be Sasuke?

347
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:27,060
Alright now.

348
00:18:27,140 --> 00:18:29,860
Those whose names have been drawn,
come forward.

349
00:18:34,099 --> 00:18:36,400
You have been chosen for the first match.

350
00:18:37,259 --> 00:18:40,100
Yoroi Okado and Sasuke Uchiha.

351
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:42,180
Are there any objections?

352
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:44,480
None here.

353
00:18:44,660 --> 00:18:45,660
No.

354
00:18:45,740 --> 00:18:46,740
Hmph.

355
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:54,120
The pain won't go away.

356
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:54,980
Hmph.

357
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:57,400
That curse mark giving you trouble.

358
00:18:59,290 --> 00:18:59,960
Okay.

359
00:18:59,961 --> 00:19:02,834
Everyone other than the
two opposing candidates

360
00:19:02,835 --> 00:19:05,321
will now clear the area
and move to the upper level.

361
00:19:16,190 --> 00:19:16,910
Hey!

362
00:19:16,911 --> 00:19:18,290
Kakashi-sensei!

363
00:19:19,990 --> 00:19:20,990
Sasuke.

364
00:19:23,370 --> 00:19:24,970
Don't use your shotgun.

365
00:19:27,930 --> 00:19:29,750
So you know about it.

366
00:19:29,751 --> 00:19:34,790
If that mark on your neck gets out of
control, your life could be in danger.

367
00:19:37,050 --> 00:19:38,250
I'm aware of that.

368
00:19:38,830 --> 00:19:41,065
Just to let you
know, if it gets to that

369
00:19:41,066 --> 00:19:43,530
point, I'll have to step
in and stop the fight.

370
00:19:43,950 --> 00:19:44,950
Good luck.

371
00:19:46,310 --> 00:19:47,350
Stop the fight?

372
00:19:50,390 --> 00:19:53,990
This thing... it seems to be responding to
my chakra.

373
00:19:55,130 --> 00:19:58,090
I've got to fight him without using my
Sharingan.

374
00:19:58,091 --> 00:20:00,390
And even my own jutsu is off limits.

375
00:20:00,950 --> 00:20:03,270
Maybe I can make him laugh himself to
death.

376
00:20:07,230 --> 00:20:08,850
The thing is, Sasuke.

377
00:20:09,510 --> 00:20:13,330
Yoroi's unique skills are going to be
disastrous for you.

378
00:20:16,850 --> 00:20:19,610
Then if you're ready, let the match begin.

379
00:20:19,990 --> 00:20:21,010
Oh, I'm ready.

380
00:20:22,050 --> 00:20:23,150
So am I.

381
00:20:30,420 --> 00:20:31,440
Ah!

382
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,000
Already?

383
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,400
Really?

384
00:20:53,860 --> 00:20:54,960
What's happening?

385
00:20:54,961 --> 00:20:55,961
What's happening?

386
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:03,920
All my strength!

387
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:06,120
Suddenly it's gone!

388
00:21:21,950 --> 00:21:23,710
My chakra!

389
00:21:24,050 --> 00:21:25,650
You're stealing it from me!

390
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:30,490
You finally caught on, huh?

391
00:21:36,370 --> 00:21:37,770
That's right, Sasuke.

392
00:21:37,950 --> 00:21:39,710
He's draining your chakra.

393
00:21:40,330 --> 00:21:43,790
Yoroi has an extraordinary ninja art at
his fingertips.

394
00:21:44,250 --> 00:21:50,030
He can absorb an opponent's spiritual and
physical energy with the palm of his hand.

395
00:21:50,410 --> 00:21:54,530
And once the last drop of your chakra has
been drained from you, Sasuke,

396
00:21:55,250 --> 00:21:57,370
you'll have no other choice but to refuse.

397
00:21:57,390 --> 00:21:59,470
Rely on the power of the Curse Mark.

398
00:22:05,590 --> 00:22:07,590
Get off me!

399
00:22:12,510 --> 00:22:16,270
So, you've still got some strength left,
huh?

400
00:22:16,770 --> 00:22:17,770
Impressive.

401
00:22:18,209 --> 00:22:19,350
For a guinea pig.

402
00:22:24,410 --> 00:22:26,030
Hey, Sasuke!

403
00:22:26,610 --> 00:22:28,030
Come on, man!

404
00:22:28,031 --> 00:22:29,031
What was that?

405
00:22:29,070 --> 00:22:30,830
And you call yourself an Uchiha?

406
00:22:31,790 --> 00:22:34,170
You're gonna let this goon walk all over
you!

407
00:22:34,390 --> 00:22:35,150
Come on!

408
00:22:35,250 --> 00:22:37,170
Stop messing around and get it in gear!

409
00:22:39,590 --> 00:22:40,110
Wait!

410
00:22:40,290 --> 00:22:41,290
That's it!

411
00:22:43,250 --> 00:22:45,650
I'll teach you to turn your back on me!

412
00:22:51,970 --> 00:22:53,950
Is this as far as it goes?

413
00:23:02,130 --> 00:23:03,130
That's my move!

414
00:23:03,590 --> 00:23:04,590
Huh?

415
00:23:05,210 --> 00:23:06,570
Okay, I admit it.

416
00:23:06,690 --> 00:23:08,170
I kind of borrowed that move.

417
00:23:08,390 --> 00:23:11,690
But from here on in, it's all original.

418
00:23:13,610 --> 00:23:14,130
No!

419
00:23:14,570 --> 00:23:15,090
No!

420
00:23:15,091 --> 00:23:16,091
No!

421
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:17,790
No!

422
00:23:17,890 --> 00:23:18,890
No!

423
00:23:21,730 --> 00:23:22,930
No!

424
00:23:23,330 --> 00:23:26,290
I won't let this thing take over!

425
00:23:26,550 --> 00:23:28,090
No way!

426
00:23:30,650 --> 00:23:31,650
Sasuke!

427
00:23:32,730 --> 00:23:33,730
Sasuke!

428
00:23:34,850 --> 00:23:36,050
Sasuke!

429
00:23:37,610 --> 00:23:38,810
Sasuke!

430
00:23:40,050 --> 00:23:41,350
Here we go.

431
00:23:41,550 --> 00:23:42,550
Huh?

432
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:43,950
Huh?

433
00:23:55,710 --> 00:23:57,150
I can do this!

434
00:23:57,850 --> 00:23:58,850
Huh?

435
00:24:05,350 --> 00:24:06,350
Well,

436
00:24:13,235 --> 00:24:14,500
this one's had it.

437
00:24:24,450 --> 00:24:25,310
I'm apples and oranges right away.

438
00:24:25,311 --> 00:24:26,570
Declaring this match over.

439
00:24:29,379 --> 00:24:34,130
As the winner of this preliminary round,
Sasuke Uchiha advances to the finals.

440
00:24:34,510 --> 00:24:35,510
Way to go!

441
00:24:43,750 --> 00:24:44,750
Hmm.

442
00:24:44,930 --> 00:24:46,030
Not bad.

443
00:24:48,139 --> 00:24:51,132
Funny, before the Lion's
Barrage, your technique

444
00:24:51,133 --> 00:24:53,770
was very reminiscent
of Gai's taijutsu.

445
00:24:54,010 --> 00:24:54,670
You okay?

446
00:24:54,671 --> 00:24:57,670
Hey, Sasuke!

447
00:24:58,010 --> 00:25:00,370
You won, but in such an uncool way!

448
00:25:00,590 --> 00:25:03,350
You came out looking like you're the one
who got beat up!

449
00:25:03,890 --> 00:25:04,890
Idiot.

450
00:25:05,069 --> 00:25:08,151
Give me a break,
you little... Oh well.

451
00:25:10,170 --> 00:25:11,750
Sasuke, thank goodness.

452
00:25:12,454 --> 00:25:14,530
I can't wait until it's my turn!

453
00:25:18,250 --> 00:25:18,810
Hmm.

454
00:25:19,250 --> 00:25:20,250
Impressive.

455
00:25:20,410 --> 00:25:22,425
Bet you can't expect
to master high-speed

456
00:25:22,426 --> 00:25:24,570
taijutsu and lotus
movements just like that.

457
00:25:24,670 --> 00:25:26,230
It takes more than shotgun.

458
00:25:26,730 --> 00:25:31,730
It takes blood, and sweat, and brutal
training that whittles away your flesh.

459
00:25:32,510 --> 00:25:37,191
Even so, that last
move of yours... Hmm.

460
00:25:37,730 --> 00:25:40,150
He reminds me of you, Kakashi.

461
00:25:40,670 --> 00:25:42,030
When you were young.

462
00:25:52,790 --> 00:25:53,790
Well, well.

463
00:25:53,850 --> 00:25:55,030
So that's how it's done.

464
00:25:56,430 --> 00:25:59,050
I knew all the time he'd be okay!

465
00:25:59,470 --> 00:26:00,470
Hahaha!

466
00:26:01,130 --> 00:26:02,330
You're out of the line for us.

467
00:26:03,229 --> 00:26:04,250
Man, I'm hungry.

468
00:26:04,610 --> 00:26:05,130
Wow!

469
00:26:05,570 --> 00:26:06,570
He was amazing!

470
00:26:07,010 --> 00:26:09,430
Ah, it wasn't anything that special.

471
00:26:14,490 --> 00:26:15,490
Magnificent!

472
00:26:17,580 --> 00:26:18,580
Sasuke Uchiha.

473
00:26:19,859 --> 00:26:23,770
Maybe you should come along to the infirmary,
too, and let us treat your injuries.

474
00:26:24,219 --> 00:26:26,290
I think you're out of your league with
this one.

475
00:26:26,710 --> 00:26:27,710
Huh?

476
00:26:28,229 --> 00:26:29,229
I'll look after him.

477
00:26:31,130 --> 00:26:31,910
Okay, up you go.

478
00:26:32,130 --> 00:26:33,370
You're coming with me.

479
00:26:34,399 --> 00:26:36,430
We've got to seal that curse mark.

480
00:26:36,859 --> 00:26:38,470
Before the preliminaries are over?

481
00:26:39,299 --> 00:26:41,270
I want to see who gets to go on to the
finals.

482
00:26:41,689 --> 00:26:42,410
Forget it.

483
00:26:42,550 --> 00:26:44,870
But... And don't
even think of arguing.

484
00:26:45,689 --> 00:26:48,450
If we leave it any longer, who knows,
it may be too late.

485
00:26:49,189 --> 00:26:51,670
I've already cut you enough slack as it
is.

486
00:26:52,349 --> 00:26:53,410
Come on, let's go.

487
00:26:55,130 --> 00:26:56,130
...

488
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:07,720
Uh, okay then.

489
00:27:07,721 --> 00:27:10,320
Let's move right on to the second match.

490
00:27:19,500 --> 00:27:20,500
Hah!

491
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:22,080
Which sucker is that?

492
00:27:31,380 --> 00:27:32,700
Step forward, please.

493
00:27:37,750 --> 00:27:38,750
Very good.

494
00:27:39,259 --> 00:27:41,250
Now, if you're both ready, then we'll
begin.

495
00:27:44,044 --> 00:27:46,210
How's he going to fight with those arms?

496
00:27:47,110 --> 00:27:48,110
...

497
00:27:48,870 --> 00:27:49,870
Candidates ready?

498
00:27:50,330 --> 00:27:51,330
Begin.

499
00:27:51,729 --> 00:27:55,890
Well, Zaku, how you pull this one off will
be a sight to see.

500
00:28:05,910 --> 00:28:10,070
If you fight me, you won't be able to
recover.

501
00:28:11,110 --> 00:28:12,850
Forfeit and withdraw.

502
00:28:13,430 --> 00:28:13,990
Heh.

503
00:28:14,430 --> 00:28:15,750
Well, what do you know?

504
00:28:15,751 --> 00:28:17,750
I've got a little movement in one of them.

505
00:28:17,970 --> 00:28:18,970
...

506
00:28:21,970 --> 00:28:24,790
One good arm's more than enough to beat
you!

507
00:28:25,650 --> 00:28:26,330
... Heh!

508
00:28:26,550 --> 00:28:27,550
...

509
00:28:28,650 --> 00:28:31,650
You couldn't beat me using both your arms.

510
00:28:32,070 --> 00:28:34,010
Yeah, well, I've got news for ya!

511
00:28:34,170 --> 00:28:35,170
...

512
00:28:36,250 --> 00:28:37,290
Try this!

513
00:28:37,770 --> 00:28:39,490
... I'll slice it that way!

514
00:28:40,510 --> 00:28:41,230
... ...

515
00:28:42,050 --> 00:28:43,050
...

516
00:28:46,010 --> 00:28:47,410
Lmao!

517
00:28:50,110 --> 00:28:51,510
Nope.

518
00:29:11,420 --> 00:29:13,020
No, I got this!

519
00:29:13,520 --> 00:29:14,520
...

520
00:29:25,060 --> 00:29:27,000
Curs ceiling!

521
00:29:29,189 --> 00:29:30,200
Mate, wake up!!

522
00:29:34,340 --> 00:29:36,840
Good evening.

523
00:29:36,841 --> 00:29:37,180
Darkother!

524
00:29:37,280 --> 00:29:38,640
I've been waiting for you, Doctor.

525
00:29:54,640 --> 00:29:55,260
There.

526
00:29:55,261 --> 00:30:00,500
Now the next time that curse mark starts
acting up, the seal should keep it in check.

527
00:30:01,159 --> 00:30:07,940
But remember, this curse-sealing jutsu is
only as strong as you are.

528
00:30:08,589 --> 00:30:11,320
It derives its power from the strength of
your will.

529
00:30:12,484 --> 00:30:16,141
If that will ever weakens,
if you ever begin to doubt

530
00:30:16,142 --> 00:30:19,800
yourself, the curse will
be unleashed in all its fury.

531
00:30:20,300 --> 00:30:21,300
Hmph.

532
00:30:22,510 --> 00:30:23,510
Amazing.

533
00:30:23,760 --> 00:30:26,000
Too tired to even argue.

534
00:30:27,599 --> 00:30:29,900
My, how you've grown.

535
00:30:31,260 --> 00:30:36,240
To think you've become strong enough to
perform the curse-sealing jutsu.

536
00:30:40,280 --> 00:30:41,280
You.

537
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:42,180
You.

538
00:30:42,340 --> 00:30:43,340
You.

539
00:30:49,320 --> 00:30:51,980
Long time no see, Kakashi.

540
00:30:54,400 --> 00:30:55,400
Orochimaru.

541
00:30:57,880 --> 00:31:01,620
No offense, Kakashi, but I didn't come to
see you.

542
00:31:02,220 --> 00:31:05,000
My business is with that boy behind you.

543
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:09,500
What do you want with Sasuke?

544
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:13,200
You've acquired something new.

545
00:31:13,860 --> 00:31:16,180
How I envy your good fortune.

546
00:31:18,020 --> 00:31:20,740
I don't believe you had it the last time
we met.

547
00:31:21,540 --> 00:31:24,020
It's only fair that I should want it too.

548
00:31:24,420 --> 00:31:26,080
The Uchiha power.

549
00:31:30,340 --> 00:31:31,340
All right, fool!

550
00:31:31,500 --> 00:31:32,600
You had enough?

551
00:31:33,540 --> 00:31:34,100
Huh?!

552
00:31:34,101 --> 00:31:35,101
Hmph!

553
00:31:37,390 --> 00:31:38,390
Ah!

554
00:31:48,360 --> 00:31:48,920
Hmmph!

555
00:31:48,921 --> 00:31:52,140
He's got bugs coming out of him,
like a human hive!

556
00:31:54,900 --> 00:31:59,380
There are rare species of parasitic beetle
that attack their prey in a swarm,

557
00:31:59,620 --> 00:32:00,720
eating its chakra.

558
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:06,260
An army of this size will suck you dry in
less than a minute.

559
00:32:07,040 --> 00:32:12,260
If you use your good arm against me,
my friends will swarm you from behind.

560
00:32:13,880 --> 00:32:16,558
Conversely, if you use
your good arm to keep them

561
00:32:16,559 --> 00:32:19,261
at bay, then you'll have
me on your blind side.

562
00:32:21,120 --> 00:32:24,860
Either way, your defeat will be certain...
and unpleasant.

563
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:28,660
It's wise to always have an ace in the
hole.

564
00:32:33,020 --> 00:32:35,240
You get the message, you little punk?

565
00:32:47,000 --> 00:32:49,220
You have potential, boy.

566
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:57,040
If you leave this place and come with me,
I will make you strong, boy.

567
00:33:00,080 --> 00:33:01,080
Follow me.

568
00:33:08,790 --> 00:33:11,930
Come with me, and I will make you strong.

569
00:33:15,270 --> 00:33:16,270
That's it.

570
00:33:18,950 --> 00:33:21,310
That's never gonna happen again!

571
00:33:27,950 --> 00:33:29,910
Now you've done it!

572
00:33:30,470 --> 00:33:32,070
Now you've made me mad!

573
00:33:40,490 --> 00:33:43,030
Like you said yourself...

574
00:33:43,630 --> 00:33:45,250
Always have an ace in the hole.

575
00:33:45,830 --> 00:33:46,830
Right?

576
00:33:47,710 --> 00:33:51,770
So it was just a ploy to make us believe
he had only one good arm.

577
00:33:53,510 --> 00:33:54,510
Clever move.

578
00:33:59,990 --> 00:34:01,310
What's your game?

579
00:34:02,530 --> 00:34:05,350
This sound village that everyone's curious
about?

580
00:34:06,110 --> 00:34:06,950
It's mine.

581
00:34:07,050 --> 00:34:08,389
You see, I created it.

582
00:34:10,170 --> 00:34:13,949
But to play the game, as you put it,
I need pieces on the chessboard.

583
00:34:14,310 --> 00:34:16,389
Willing pawns to do my bidding.

584
00:34:18,270 --> 00:34:19,770
I'll blow you away!

585
00:34:20,830 --> 00:34:23,670
And Sasuke is one of your pawns?

586
00:34:24,270 --> 00:34:25,510
Oh, not a pawn.

587
00:34:25,989 --> 00:34:28,550
He's a far more valuable piece than that.

588
00:34:28,909 --> 00:34:33,290
But as for the others... Well, you
know how it is in the game of chess.

589
00:34:35,670 --> 00:34:37,310
Pieces must be sacrificed.

590
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:46,620
My arms!

591
00:34:46,800 --> 00:34:48,120
What's wrong with them?

592
00:34:49,219 --> 00:34:54,380
Earlier, while I was distracting you with
my helpful advice, I was also sending some

593
00:34:54,381 --> 00:34:58,340
of my little friends to plug up those
bothersome wind holes in your hands.

594
00:34:58,700 --> 00:35:01,100
Both hands, just to be sure.

595
00:35:01,440 --> 00:35:04,400
You see, while an ace in the hole is
good...

596
00:35:05,120 --> 00:35:06,900
Two aces are better.

597
00:35:08,620 --> 00:35:09,620
Aaaaaah!

598
00:35:10,320 --> 00:35:11,320
Aaaaaaah!

599
00:35:11,660 --> 00:35:12,660
Aaaaah!

600
00:35:17,500 --> 00:35:18,500
Aaaaah!

601
00:35:24,720 --> 00:35:25,300
Stop!

602
00:35:25,600 --> 00:35:27,040
Don't come any closer!

603
00:35:30,460 --> 00:35:32,900
I don't care if you are one of the Sunny.

604
00:35:33,080 --> 00:35:34,080
I swear.

605
00:35:34,360 --> 00:35:38,500
Take one more step towards Sasuke,
and one of us will die here!

606
00:35:48,100 --> 00:35:49,440
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

607
00:35:50,580 --> 00:35:51,800
Funny, is it?

608
00:35:52,840 --> 00:35:54,040
Poor Kakashi.

609
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:57,200
All your noble efforts, all in vain.

610
00:35:57,900 --> 00:35:58,900
What?

611
00:35:59,140 --> 00:36:01,720
Do you really believe that the seal will
hold?

612
00:36:01,900 --> 00:36:03,600
Do you think you can keep him?

613
00:36:04,580 --> 00:36:06,140
From what he truly desires?

614
00:36:06,840 --> 00:36:08,120
You know I'm right.

615
00:36:08,300 --> 00:36:13,320
A heart like his, that hungers for only
one thing, will not be denied.

616
00:36:13,720 --> 00:36:19,100
No matter what obstacles you put
in his path... He's an Avenger, isn't he?

617
00:36:19,540 --> 00:36:22,020
You think you can take advantage of that?

618
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:23,580
Not Sasuke.

619
00:36:24,500 --> 00:36:25,940
You cannot stop it.

620
00:36:26,380 --> 00:36:28,940
At some point he will come to me...

621
00:36:29,780 --> 00:36:31,760
In search of power.

622
00:36:34,350 --> 00:36:37,800
Unless, of course, you carry out your
threat to kill me.

623
00:36:38,560 --> 00:36:39,800
Now is your chance.

624
00:36:40,735 --> 00:36:42,740
Take it, if you dare.

625
00:36:51,660 --> 00:36:54,100
Huh... One of us will die here.

626
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:56,700
It must have been out of my mind.

627
00:36:57,800 --> 00:36:58,800
Aaaaaaah!

628
00:37:06,180 --> 00:37:08,630
I'd say this one... has had it.

629
00:37:10,160 --> 00:37:11,730
The winner is Shino Aburame.

630
00:37:18,470 --> 00:37:19,470
Wait!

631
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:20,880
How did he do that?

632
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:21,890
Who is he?

633
00:37:22,010 --> 00:37:23,010
Find out!

634
00:37:27,064 --> 00:37:28,064
Byakugan!

635
00:37:33,110 --> 00:37:34,670
I had no idea.

636
00:37:35,110 --> 00:37:38,390
I thought he must be using a summoning
jutsu to get all those insects.

637
00:37:38,650 --> 00:37:39,650
But no.

638
00:37:39,870 --> 00:37:41,890
They're actually living inside of him.

639
00:37:42,750 --> 00:37:44,330
Living inside of him?

640
00:37:45,110 --> 00:37:49,530
There's a legend in the leaf village of a
clan of insect tamers.

641
00:37:49,810 --> 00:37:51,650
Yes, I've heard of that clan as well.

642
00:37:52,170 --> 00:37:54,730
They say that when a bug master is born...

643
00:37:54,731 --> 00:37:57,650
he enters into a sacred pact with the
insects.

644
00:37:58,490 --> 00:38:00,590
He allows them to nest in his body.

645
00:38:00,730 --> 00:38:03,290
In return, they obey their host's will.

646
00:38:04,710 --> 00:38:06,650
So this guy is one of them?

647
00:38:06,710 --> 00:38:08,390
One of these bug tamers?

648
00:38:12,070 --> 00:38:17,390
I can't pretend we had anything in common,
except this team and our mission.

649
00:38:18,750 --> 00:38:21,810
Still, I'll even the score for you,
Zaku.

650
00:38:21,811 --> 00:38:22,811
Zaku.

651
00:38:25,310 --> 00:38:26,350
Oh, my.

652
00:38:27,580 --> 00:38:28,930
It's getting chilly in here.

653
00:38:29,780 --> 00:38:31,090
Man, that Shino is good!

654
00:38:31,425 --> 00:38:33,286
Who would have thunk it with him being so
quiet?

655
00:38:33,310 --> 00:38:35,490
I can't wait to get my shot at him!

656
00:38:35,690 --> 00:38:39,490
Wow, I thought Shino was weird before,
but now...

657
00:38:42,010 --> 00:38:45,050
Oh, wow, I... congratulations,
Shino!

658
00:38:45,310 --> 00:38:45,710
Way to go!

659
00:38:45,910 --> 00:38:46,910
Good work!

660
00:38:46,939 --> 00:38:49,630
Just see that you two do the same.

661
00:38:51,050 --> 00:38:52,050
Yeah?

662
00:38:52,230 --> 00:38:54,610
Who died and made you team leader,
huh?

663
00:38:56,650 --> 00:38:58,110
Uh, alright, everyone.

664
00:38:59,160 --> 00:39:00,790
Moving right on to the third match.

665
00:39:03,470 --> 00:39:04,510
Kakashi-sensei!

666
00:39:04,750 --> 00:39:05,750
Hi.

667
00:39:06,215 --> 00:39:07,215
What do you mean, hi?

668
00:39:07,310 --> 00:39:08,310
Is that all you can say?

669
00:39:08,980 --> 00:39:11,130
What about... what about Sasuke?

670
00:39:11,270 --> 00:39:11,850
How is he?

671
00:39:12,270 --> 00:39:13,270
Oh, he's fine.

672
00:39:13,750 --> 00:39:15,530
Sleeping soundly in the infirmary.

673
00:39:17,830 --> 00:39:20,910
But he's been put under guard by the Anbu
Black Ops.

674
00:39:24,450 --> 00:39:25,190
Heh.

675
00:39:25,191 --> 00:39:26,191
Finally.

676
00:39:26,290 --> 00:39:27,450
My turn.

677
00:39:27,790 --> 00:39:28,870
Careful, Kankuro.

678
00:39:29,110 --> 00:39:32,530
You'll underestimate your opponent one
time too many.

679
00:39:32,890 --> 00:39:33,890
Hmph.

680
00:39:34,030 --> 00:39:35,030
Idiot.

681
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:43,360
This guy!

682
00:39:51,870 --> 00:39:53,350
I'm not like Yoroi.

683
00:39:53,530 --> 00:39:54,990
I don't get careless.

684
00:39:55,210 --> 00:39:56,630
Not even against kids.

685
00:39:57,150 --> 00:39:58,150
Heh.

686
00:39:58,850 --> 00:40:00,250
A piece of advice.

687
00:40:00,890 --> 00:40:03,730
Once I go into my jutsu, give up.

688
00:40:04,430 --> 00:40:05,430
Quick.

689
00:40:05,470 --> 00:40:08,970
If you do, I promise to make it short and
painless.

690
00:40:09,530 --> 00:40:10,090
Funny.

691
00:40:10,350 --> 00:40:12,650
I was about to say the same thing.

692
00:40:12,651 --> 00:40:13,651
Hey.

693
00:40:14,110 --> 00:40:15,110
I strike!

694
00:40:15,330 --> 00:40:16,330
Shorvik-tani!

695
00:40:26,270 --> 00:40:29,670
I dislocate every one of my joints,
softening my body.

696
00:40:29,850 --> 00:40:32,670
Then, with my chakra, I can control it
perfectly.

697
00:40:33,750 --> 00:40:36,970
The more you struggle, the tighter I'll
squeeze.

698
00:40:37,630 --> 00:40:39,750
I don't know what you're carrying in
there.

699
00:40:39,751 --> 00:40:43,450
But as long as I have a hold of you,
it makes no difference.

700
00:40:43,750 --> 00:40:46,610
I could break your neck right now if I
wanted to.

701
00:40:47,650 --> 00:40:50,150
And I will, unless you give up.

702
00:40:52,490 --> 00:40:54,830
You wanna bet you'll die?

703
00:40:56,510 --> 00:40:57,630
You fool.

704
00:40:58,030 --> 00:41:00,210
You're the one who's gonna die here.

705
00:41:08,445 --> 00:41:10,560
I think he broke... his neck.

706
00:41:10,561 --> 00:41:11,561
Really?

707
00:41:12,330 --> 00:41:13,620
Too bad he didn't surrender.

708
00:41:14,120 --> 00:41:15,120
Oh well.

709
00:41:22,300 --> 00:41:25,320
Now, it's my turn, so say goodbye.

710
00:41:41,860 --> 00:41:43,140
This is just a puppet!

711
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:45,460
And the real ninja was in there,
controlling it!

712
00:41:45,580 --> 00:41:46,600
He's a puppet master!

713
00:41:50,640 --> 00:41:51,640
Enough!

714
00:41:51,980 --> 00:41:53,360
I give up!

715
00:41:53,980 --> 00:41:58,621
But if your bones are all crushed, just
think how much more flexible you'll be.

716
00:42:00,380 --> 00:42:01,440
That was close.

717
00:42:02,140 --> 00:42:04,100
I almost stopped the match in the middle.

718
00:42:04,700 --> 00:42:06,100
But it's a good thing I didn't.

719
00:42:06,780 --> 00:42:10,880
Because his opponent is unable to
continue, the winner is Konkuro.

720
00:42:11,180 --> 00:42:13,960
Two against one is hitting below the belt,
isn't it?

721
00:42:14,420 --> 00:42:17,200
I mean, is that thing even fair,
Kakashi-sensei?

722
00:42:17,705 --> 00:42:19,400
It's not really two against one.

723
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:21,100
It's a puppet, not another ninja.

724
00:42:22,240 --> 00:42:24,180
Yeah, it's just the puppet master jutsu.

725
00:42:24,850 --> 00:42:26,450
He's controlling the puppet with chakra.

726
00:42:27,510 --> 00:42:29,080
It's a ninja tool, like a shuriken.

727
00:42:31,020 --> 00:42:32,020
Now let's continue.

728
00:42:32,720 --> 00:42:34,280
It's time to begin the fourth battle.

729
00:42:34,281 --> 00:42:36,800
No matter who's picked, it'll be two
weirdos.

730
00:42:36,801 --> 00:42:38,660
This contest is chock full of them.

731
00:42:38,940 --> 00:42:40,320
Well, you're one to talk.

732
00:42:40,520 --> 00:42:41,560
Yeah, good point.

733
00:42:41,680 --> 00:42:41,820
Hey!

734
00:42:41,980 --> 00:42:42,980
Give me a break!

735
00:42:45,450 --> 00:42:47,580
This isn't a time for laughter.

736
00:42:59,440 --> 00:43:02,060
I never thought I'd fight you.

737
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:05,020
Or at least I didn't think it would happen
this soon.

738
00:43:05,620 --> 00:43:07,920
But don't expect me to go easy on you.

739
00:43:10,960 --> 00:43:11,440
I'm sorry, Sakura.

740
00:43:11,441 --> 00:43:16,080
Ino was a standout among the rookie female
shinobi, so she has a good chance to win.

741
00:43:16,360 --> 00:43:21,000
But with Sakura as her opponent, can she
bring herself to fight hard enough to do it?

742
00:43:21,140 --> 00:43:26,040
Of all the people for Ino to go up
against, it would have to be Sakura.

743
00:43:26,120 --> 00:43:27,120
What a mess.

744
00:43:27,260 --> 00:43:27,740
I know.

745
00:43:27,920 --> 00:43:29,400
I hope Ino will be okay.

746
00:43:30,020 --> 00:43:31,140
Let's all hope.

747
00:43:31,420 --> 00:43:32,940
So what's it gonna be, Ino?

748
00:43:35,260 --> 00:43:36,940
Go Sakura!

749
00:43:37,280 --> 00:43:38,800
You can do it!

750
00:43:38,960 --> 00:43:39,960
Don't lose!

751
00:43:42,820 --> 00:43:43,820
Begin.

752
00:44:21,990 --> 00:44:24,510
I'm just not very good at this kind of
stuff.

753
00:44:25,190 --> 00:44:26,230
What about you?

754
00:44:28,050 --> 00:44:30,930
That's not good considering you're named
after a cherry blossom.

755
00:44:31,350 --> 00:44:32,970
Okay, look, it's simple.

756
00:44:33,110 --> 00:44:34,190
I'll explain it, alright?

757
00:44:34,910 --> 00:44:38,230
The first thing is, find a main flower for
your bouquet.

758
00:44:38,330 --> 00:44:41,050
Then you find other flowers that
complement the main one.

759
00:44:41,150 --> 00:44:42,490
You see, flowers have to hide.

760
00:44:42,510 --> 00:44:43,726
They highlight each other's beauty.

761
00:44:43,750 --> 00:44:46,410
There's really nothing to it once you know
all the tricks.

762
00:44:46,849 --> 00:44:49,150
For example, look.

763
00:44:50,110 --> 00:44:52,810
You see those cosmos flowers over there?

764
00:44:54,130 --> 00:44:57,789
Well, if they were the main
flowers in your arrangement, then

765
00:44:57,790 --> 00:45:00,370
the thorough wart flowers you
picked would complement them.

766
00:45:02,110 --> 00:45:04,731
Cosmos flowers are also
called autumn cherry blossoms,

767
00:45:04,732 --> 00:45:06,971
and they're the prettiest
flowers in the fall.

768
00:45:07,310 --> 00:45:09,490
Their name comes from an old word that
means harmony.

769
00:45:09,750 --> 00:45:11,990
They can harmonize with all the other
flowers.

770
00:45:12,510 --> 00:45:16,211
And any autumn grass will go just perfectly
with them in a flower arrangement.

771
00:45:18,710 --> 00:45:22,050
So, tell me, do I look as pretty as the
cosmos flowers now?

772
00:45:22,290 --> 00:45:23,790
Come on, am I cute?

773
00:45:27,890 --> 00:45:28,890
Yeah.

774
00:45:29,234 --> 00:45:31,370
Sheesh, took you long enough to say it.

775
00:45:33,110 --> 00:45:37,410
Well, you sure look like you're having a
lot of fun, Billboard Brow.

776
00:45:41,630 --> 00:45:44,660
You know, you're still nothing but a
hopeless little girl, Sakura.

777
00:45:45,700 --> 00:45:48,020
So don't go strutting around like you're
hot stuff, got it?

778
00:45:52,580 --> 00:45:53,580
Ami!

779
00:45:54,300 --> 00:45:55,300
Sorry.

780
00:45:55,780 --> 00:45:58,230
That head of yours is so
empty that I mistook it for

781
00:45:58,231 --> 00:46:00,480
a vase and thought I'd
better put flowers in there.

782
00:46:02,040 --> 00:46:03,040
No!

783
00:46:04,250 --> 00:46:05,920
It's aconite, a shinobi flower.

784
00:46:06,500 --> 00:46:09,068
I guess it really isn't that
poisonous, but still, you

785
00:46:09,069 --> 00:46:11,260
might want to spit those
out when you get a chance.

786
00:46:18,900 --> 00:46:21,840
I forgot to say only the root is
poisonous.

787
00:46:26,680 --> 00:46:28,340
Ino is so great.

788
00:46:29,160 --> 00:46:31,240
She knows practically everything.

789
00:46:31,580 --> 00:46:34,540
Her clothes are so stylish, and she's way
cute.

790
00:46:35,300 --> 00:46:37,360
She's even good with her shirt again.

791
00:46:37,660 --> 00:46:39,840
And her ninjutsu is awesome, too.

792
00:46:40,480 --> 00:46:43,720
Compared to that, I'm... nothing.

793
00:46:45,720 --> 00:46:46,980
Hey, what's wrong?

794
00:46:48,570 --> 00:46:53,980
Ino, if you're a cosmos flower,
then am I just a thorough wart?

795
00:46:56,620 --> 00:46:57,760
Now why would you say that?

796
00:46:59,880 --> 00:47:01,680
Well, let's see...

797
00:47:02,520 --> 00:47:05,000
Actually, I don't think you're a flower at
all, Sakura.

798
00:47:05,180 --> 00:47:06,920
You're still a bud waiting to bloom.

799
00:47:10,780 --> 00:47:11,840
Yeah, you're right.

800
00:47:13,559 --> 00:47:14,559
Say...

801
00:47:15,504 --> 00:47:16,504
Ino?

802
00:47:17,530 --> 00:47:20,300
Why did... you give me this ribbon?

803
00:47:20,915 --> 00:47:21,995
What's it supposed to mean?

804
00:47:25,260 --> 00:47:27,286
Let's just say that I
thought it would be a real

805
00:47:27,287 --> 00:47:29,801
big waste for you to wilt
away as nothing but a bud.

806
00:47:36,215 --> 00:47:38,880
I mean, how sad is it if flowers don't
ever bloom?

807
00:47:40,620 --> 00:47:42,081
Hmm... Hmm...

808
00:47:46,500 --> 00:47:47,500
Hmm...

809
00:47:56,980 --> 00:47:58,380
I don't want to feel sorry for you.

810
00:47:59,340 --> 00:48:02,680
Now, what are you so angry about?

811
00:48:04,580 --> 00:48:05,580
Ino?

812
00:48:07,740 --> 00:48:08,740
What's that in your head?

813
00:48:08,940 --> 00:48:09,940
Don't you understand?

814
00:48:11,780 --> 00:48:12,600
I don't know.

815
00:48:12,740 --> 00:48:16,940
I don't know how to describe it.

816
00:48:16,941 --> 00:48:19,940
A flower instead of a bud, always waiting
but never blooming.

817
00:48:20,640 --> 00:48:25,160
So I set my sights on you, because I
wanted to be like you from the start.

818
00:48:25,900 --> 00:48:29,780
You set an example for me that gave me a
goal to strive toward.

819
00:48:30,460 --> 00:48:34,160
And it's because of that, that I made it
as far as I did.

820
00:48:34,780 --> 00:48:36,260
It's why I'm here today.

821
00:48:37,780 --> 00:48:40,560
But now, I don't want you to hold back.

822
00:49:04,430 --> 00:49:06,690
What in the world is going on?

823
00:49:07,480 --> 00:49:08,480
What do you mean?

824
00:49:08,800 --> 00:49:11,850
Why are those two getting so worked up
just looking at each other?

825
00:49:14,010 --> 00:49:18,610
He just can't see that he's exactly the
same way when it comes to Sasuke.

826
00:49:20,285 --> 00:49:22,950
Well, Naruto, rivalry is a tricky
business.

827
00:49:23,210 --> 00:49:24,710
Not that I would know.

828
00:49:24,950 --> 00:49:25,950
Hmm?

829
00:49:27,130 --> 00:49:29,190
Oh, hi there.

830
00:49:29,820 --> 00:49:33,210
What else would I expect from my old rival
Kakashi?

831
00:49:33,450 --> 00:49:35,470
Yet another glib, senseless statement.

832
00:49:35,790 --> 00:49:38,410
Man, it burns me up when he acts so cool!

833
00:49:40,600 --> 00:49:43,370
I understand, Sakura.

834
00:49:58,890 --> 00:50:00,950
This time, we do this right.

835
00:50:01,810 --> 00:50:03,210
No holding back.

836
00:50:04,850 --> 00:50:06,210
A fair fight.

837
00:50:07,750 --> 00:50:09,390
And I'm going to win!

838
00:50:12,630 --> 00:50:14,370
Just a plain old jutsu?

839
00:50:15,170 --> 00:50:18,010
This isn't just some Ninja Academy
graduation exam!

840
00:50:18,130 --> 00:50:21,390
Do you really think you can beat me with a
basic ninja art like that?

841
00:50:21,710 --> 00:50:22,710
No!

842
00:50:24,550 --> 00:50:26,510
I'm not some crybaby anymore!

843
00:50:26,511 --> 00:50:29,150
You play with fire, and you're gonna get
burned!

844
00:50:39,730 --> 00:50:43,590
No matter how good Sakura is, Ino is just
as good!

845
00:50:43,750 --> 00:50:45,570
This battle will rage for quite a while!

846
00:50:54,560 --> 00:50:57,100
Man, since when did she get this strong?

847
00:50:58,420 --> 00:51:00,000
I can do this!

848
00:51:00,440 --> 00:51:01,740
I know I can!

849
00:51:02,540 --> 00:51:03,540
You little...!

850
00:51:07,840 --> 00:51:08,840
Whoa...

851
00:51:09,120 --> 00:51:10,560
This has been going on so long.

852
00:51:12,070 --> 00:51:13,470
They've been at it for ten minutes.

853
00:51:14,230 --> 00:51:15,800
This isn't how this was supposed to go!

854
00:51:15,940 --> 00:51:17,720
How can you be evenly matched with me?

855
00:51:18,080 --> 00:51:19,080
Heh.

856
00:51:19,565 --> 00:51:20,680
I guess you're right, Ino.

857
00:51:20,800 --> 00:51:23,700
Your obsession with your looks and your
hair can't be surpassed.

858
00:51:23,925 --> 00:51:26,340
I've been training too hard to worry about
that stuff.

859
00:51:30,060 --> 00:51:31,520
You're gonna pay for that!

860
00:51:31,700 --> 00:51:33,800
I've had enough of you making fun of me!

861
00:51:34,140 --> 00:51:35,160
What an idiot.

862
00:51:35,580 --> 00:51:37,060
Ino's falling for a trap.

863
00:51:37,540 --> 00:51:40,880
She's so riled up by Sakura, there's no
telling what she'll do.

864
00:51:41,080 --> 00:51:43,500
Oh man, I hate it when she's like this.

865
00:51:53,140 --> 00:51:54,140
Huh.

866
00:51:57,420 --> 00:52:01,060
Oh, I think she's totally lost it this
time.

867
00:52:01,061 --> 00:52:02,460
That's it!

868
00:52:08,280 --> 00:52:10,700
This ends right now!

869
00:52:42,210 --> 00:52:45,300
Since neither combatant is able to
continue...

870
00:52:45,301 --> 00:52:49,300
By double knockout, no one gets through
the fourth battle of this preliminary.

871
00:52:49,810 --> 00:52:51,160
This match is over.

872
00:52:51,680 --> 00:52:52,680
Sakura!

873
00:52:52,760 --> 00:52:53,900
No way!

874
00:52:56,480 --> 00:52:57,800
Very well then.

875
00:52:58,200 --> 00:52:59,560
I've had grief.

876
00:53:01,080 --> 00:53:02,460
Hey, Ino!

877
00:53:03,000 --> 00:53:04,100
Sakura, no!

878
00:53:04,300 --> 00:53:05,320
Sakura, wake up!

879
00:53:05,820 --> 00:53:06,920
Are you okay?

880
00:53:08,580 --> 00:53:09,580
Shhh.

881
00:53:19,150 --> 00:53:20,150
I'm so ready.

882
00:53:20,250 --> 00:53:23,090
After watching that last match,
I'm fired up.

883
00:53:25,000 --> 00:53:27,850
So, this is another genin from the sand
village.

884
00:53:27,851 --> 00:53:29,770
Go, Ten-ten!

885
00:53:29,850 --> 00:53:31,290
This should be interesting to watch.

886
00:53:33,530 --> 00:53:35,050
For the fifth match.

887
00:53:35,630 --> 00:53:36,670
Ten-ten.

888
00:53:37,330 --> 00:53:38,330
Temari.

889
00:53:38,630 --> 00:53:39,630
Get ready.

890
00:53:46,999 --> 00:53:50,090
So you're finally waking up, huh,
Sakura?

891
00:53:53,040 --> 00:53:54,570
Come on, Ten-ten!

892
00:53:54,870 --> 00:53:56,150
Use the power of you!

893
00:53:56,310 --> 00:53:56,850
Nice, Lee!

894
00:53:56,851 --> 00:53:57,851
Let's hear that support!

895
00:53:58,110 --> 00:53:59,610
You can do it, Ten-ten!

896
00:53:59,690 --> 00:54:01,150
Take her down, Ten-ten!

897
00:54:01,410 --> 00:54:03,070
Our match is already over.

898
00:54:03,210 --> 00:54:04,890
To think I tied with you.

899
00:54:04,930 --> 00:54:06,370
I still can't believe that happened.

900
00:54:09,910 --> 00:54:10,910
Here.

901
00:54:13,890 --> 00:54:16,250
Guess you finally got a flower to bloom.

902
00:54:17,030 --> 00:54:18,570
A beautiful flower.

903
00:54:25,490 --> 00:54:26,490
Zero.

904
00:54:36,390 --> 00:54:41,750
But Sakura... The next time you fight, you
won't just take the easy way by feinting.

905
00:54:43,310 --> 00:54:46,750
And don't forget, we won't just hand over
Sasuke to you.

906
00:54:46,810 --> 00:54:48,270
Understand, Sakura!?

907
00:54:48,271 --> 00:54:49,271
Ready.

908
00:54:49,610 --> 00:54:52,950
Oh yeah, well that goes double for you,
Ino, you ugly pig!

909
00:54:57,660 --> 00:54:59,970
Whoa, that girl's really ruthless.

910
00:55:00,470 --> 00:55:01,710
Oh, Denton.

911
00:55:03,055 --> 00:55:04,470
Wasn't much of a match.

912
00:55:05,050 --> 00:55:06,170
Kind of boring.

913
00:55:07,930 --> 00:55:10,830
The winner of the fifth match,
Tamari.

914
00:55:13,270 --> 00:55:14,370
Wait a second!

915
00:55:21,730 --> 00:55:23,230
Hey, nice catch.

916
00:55:24,280 --> 00:55:25,330
What is wrong with you?

917
00:55:25,830 --> 00:55:29,490
She may have lost, but that is no way to
treat an opponent who has done her best!

918
00:55:30,345 --> 00:55:31,430
I'll beat it.

919
00:55:31,945 --> 00:55:34,470
And take that sack of garbage with you.

920
00:55:34,890 --> 00:55:35,890
No, Lee!

921
00:55:36,230 --> 00:55:37,910
Lee, leave her again!

922
00:55:38,770 --> 00:55:39,770
What?

923
00:55:40,070 --> 00:55:41,250
Not even close.

924
00:55:42,130 --> 00:55:43,250
Lee, stop!

925
00:55:43,910 --> 00:55:45,290
Wait, Gai-sensei!

926
00:55:45,470 --> 00:55:47,490
Tamari, forget them.

927
00:55:47,491 --> 00:55:50,190
The match is over, so get up here.

928
00:55:50,930 --> 00:55:51,970
You won.

929
00:55:52,110 --> 00:55:56,270
Why are you wasting your time with that
pathetic loser and his ridiculous mentor?

930
00:55:56,750 --> 00:55:57,750
What?

931
00:56:01,550 --> 00:56:03,010
A word of warning.

932
00:56:03,490 --> 00:56:07,330
You sand villagers have no idea what Lee
is capable of.

933
00:56:08,690 --> 00:56:11,070
Remember, he still hasn't fought yet.

934
00:56:11,390 --> 00:56:13,510
So I'd be careful if I were you.

935
00:56:16,790 --> 00:56:19,310
That kid's crazy picking a fight with
them.

936
00:56:20,270 --> 00:56:22,250
Those sand village guys are trouble.

937
00:56:22,430 --> 00:56:24,430
They're the last people I'd want to go up
against.

938
00:56:24,850 --> 00:56:27,010
They do look almost unbeatable.

939
00:56:33,130 --> 00:56:34,230
Don't worry, Naruto.

940
00:56:34,490 --> 00:56:35,990
I'm sure you could take him.

941
00:56:37,450 --> 00:56:38,450
Sakura?

942
00:56:38,610 --> 00:56:39,130
What?

943
00:56:39,250 --> 00:56:39,670
You're alright?

944
00:56:39,810 --> 00:56:41,890
I never thought you'd be back so soon.

945
00:56:41,891 --> 00:56:43,610
I'm fine, but never mind me.

946
00:56:43,730 --> 00:56:45,310
It's you you should be thinking about.

947
00:56:45,550 --> 00:56:45,870
Huh?

948
00:56:46,230 --> 00:56:47,230
Me?

949
00:56:47,400 --> 00:56:48,270
I don't have any injuries.

950
00:56:48,350 --> 00:56:49,550
I haven't even fought yet.

951
00:56:50,090 --> 00:56:52,278
What I meant was you
don't want to disgrace

952
00:56:52,279 --> 00:56:54,510
yourself after you
worked so hard to get here.

953
00:56:54,890 --> 00:56:56,250
Think of what Sasuke will say.

954
00:56:57,090 --> 00:56:57,470
Oh.

955
00:56:57,490 --> 00:56:58,490
Oh, right.

956
00:57:02,870 --> 00:57:03,930
Here we go!

957
00:57:04,250 --> 00:57:05,010
Let it be me!

958
00:57:05,090 --> 00:57:05,890
Please let it be me!

959
00:57:06,010 --> 00:57:06,650
Let it be me!

960
00:57:06,650 --> 00:57:06,650
Let it be me!

961
00:57:06,670 --> 00:57:07,110
No, it's my turn!

962
00:57:07,250 --> 00:57:07,730
My turn!

963
00:57:08,150 --> 00:57:11,870
No, it's my turn!

964
00:57:11,870 --> 00:57:11,870
My turn!

965
00:57:12,570 --> 00:57:13,670
Guess it's me.

966
00:57:14,010 --> 00:57:16,330
Remember, he manipulates shadows.

967
00:57:16,870 --> 00:57:18,150
Watch the shadows.

968
00:57:19,230 --> 00:57:20,230
Heh.

969
00:57:20,550 --> 00:57:23,830
You think I'd ever fall for a stupid jutsu
like that?

970
00:57:24,350 --> 00:57:25,350
Yeah, okay!

971
00:57:25,510 --> 00:57:26,610
Here we go, Shigemaru!

972
00:57:26,750 --> 00:57:28,070
Make that little girl cry!

973
00:57:28,765 --> 00:57:30,590
Oh man, this is such a drag.

974
00:57:31,030 --> 00:57:32,430
I mean, give me a break.

975
00:57:32,570 --> 00:57:34,030
I've gotta fight a girl.

976
00:57:34,690 --> 00:57:37,290
Yeah, you just keep thinking that way,
little man.

977
00:57:38,250 --> 00:57:41,850
I know what these guys are capable of from
the time we met them in the first place.

978
00:57:41,851 --> 00:57:43,531
They fought for us during the second exam.

979
00:57:44,354 --> 00:57:47,830
Problem is, I didn't get a look at her
jutsu.

980
00:57:48,230 --> 00:57:51,730
And to make things worse, she saw mine.

981
00:57:52,710 --> 00:57:53,230
Ready?

982
00:57:53,530 --> 00:57:54,390
Oh well.

983
00:57:54,510 --> 00:57:55,070
Sixth match.

984
00:57:55,480 --> 00:57:56,480
Nothing I can do.

985
00:57:56,590 --> 00:57:57,590
Shigemaru and Keen.

986
00:57:58,230 --> 00:57:58,750
Begin.

987
00:57:59,230 --> 00:58:00,230
Ninja Art!

988
00:58:00,310 --> 00:58:01,830
Shadow Possession Jutsu!

989
00:58:02,070 --> 00:58:03,230
Is that all you know?

990
00:58:03,390 --> 00:58:06,870
If that's the only trick you've got,
this is going to be easier than I thought!

991
00:58:11,850 --> 00:58:12,850
Bells?

992
00:58:13,370 --> 00:58:16,230
Heh, oh please, not that old trick.

993
00:58:16,850 --> 00:58:19,156
Lemme guess, next
you'll throw Senbon with

994
00:58:19,157 --> 00:58:21,930
bells and Senbon without
bells at the same time.

995
00:58:22,130 --> 00:58:23,770
You sure talk a lot, don't you?

996
00:58:24,010 --> 00:58:26,770
Now I know to be careful to dodge all the
Senbon.

997
00:58:27,070 --> 00:58:28,990
Not just the ones with the bells.

998
00:58:30,990 --> 00:58:31,990
What?

999
00:58:32,090 --> 00:58:33,090
Where?

1000
00:58:36,204 --> 00:58:36,990
Threats?

1001
00:58:36,991 --> 00:58:37,991
Too late!

1002
00:58:38,050 --> 00:58:39,050
Gah!

1003
00:58:39,650 --> 00:58:40,210
Shigemaru!

1004
00:58:40,211 --> 00:58:42,410
Well that didn't take long.

1005
00:58:42,770 --> 00:58:44,130
Hold on, don't be so sure.

1006
00:58:44,210 --> 00:58:45,210
He's not beaten yet.

1007
00:58:45,510 --> 00:58:46,650
Can't move my arm!

1008
00:58:46,890 --> 00:58:52,430
Heh, looks like my lame shadow jutsu was a
success after all.

1009
00:58:52,570 --> 00:58:54,850
But you haven't thrown any shadows.

1010
00:58:55,130 --> 00:58:57,050
No way I made sure of it!

1011
00:58:57,330 --> 00:58:59,650
Heh, you really still don't see it?

1012
00:59:00,510 --> 00:59:01,930
What do you mean?

1013
00:59:02,510 --> 00:59:03,990
Look at that thread you're holding.

1014
00:59:04,170 --> 00:59:08,010
Don't you find it a little strange that it
would even cast a shadow at this height?

1015
00:59:10,210 --> 00:59:13,290
Of course you didn't notice it because you
were concentrating on other things,

1016
00:59:13,410 --> 00:59:14,410
like killing me.

1017
00:59:17,570 --> 00:59:20,890
And now, so we mirror each other's
movements, so what?

1018
00:59:21,090 --> 00:59:23,430
A cute trick, but what do you gain by it?

1019
00:59:23,650 --> 00:59:24,690
Man, you're annoying.

1020
00:59:30,650 --> 00:59:31,690
You wouldn't!

1021
00:59:31,691 --> 00:59:32,691
You couldn't!

1022
00:59:32,930 --> 00:59:35,930
Yeah, like a game of chicken, let's see
who ducks first!

1023
00:59:35,931 --> 00:59:36,931
You're crazy!

1024
00:59:39,930 --> 00:59:41,990
Big deal, I'll do that too!

1025
00:59:42,770 --> 00:59:45,190
And that's what I call using your head.

1026
00:59:46,990 --> 00:59:51,150
The wise shinobi carefully scouts the
physical layout of the battlefield,

1027
00:59:51,610 --> 00:59:54,710
and never loses sight of his position on
it.

1028
00:59:54,850 --> 00:59:57,110
Winner of the sixth match, Shikamaru Nara.

1029
00:59:57,530 --> 00:59:58,870
Atta boy, Shikamaru!

1030
00:59:59,150 --> 01:00:00,150
Yeah, way to go!

1031
01:00:00,610 --> 01:00:02,910
Alright, moving on to the next match.

1032
01:00:03,290 --> 01:00:05,490
There's one sound village ninja left.

1033
01:00:05,650 --> 01:00:06,770
There's me, you, and me.

1034
01:00:06,771 --> 01:00:10,870
You, Naruto, Choji, Neji, Lee,
and that sand village guy.

1035
01:00:11,650 --> 01:00:14,450
Just don't put me up against him,
that's all I ask.

1036
01:00:16,030 --> 01:00:19,030
This year's rookies look like they could
be quite a challenge.

1037
01:00:28,090 --> 01:00:28,530
Yeah!

1038
01:00:28,890 --> 01:00:29,510
It's here!

1039
01:00:29,630 --> 01:00:30,390
It's here at last!

1040
01:00:30,590 --> 01:00:32,150
The moment I've been waiting for!

1041
01:00:32,710 --> 01:00:34,870
Finally, I get a chance to show what I've
got!

1042
01:00:35,170 --> 01:00:35,930
Look at that!

1043
01:00:36,110 --> 01:00:37,250
It's us against the kid!

1044
01:00:37,590 --> 01:00:40,410
Hey, Akamaru, I think you and I just won
the lottery!

1045
01:00:40,411 --> 01:00:41,411
Sure!

1046
01:00:42,330 --> 01:00:45,470
I am going to die of old age before I get
my turn!

1047
01:00:45,790 --> 01:00:48,510
I just want a chance to show Sakura what
I'm made of!

1048
01:00:48,770 --> 01:00:50,570
She's going to get tired of waiting!

1049
01:00:50,850 --> 01:00:52,410
All I want is a chance!

1050
01:00:52,510 --> 01:00:53,750
Is that too much to ask?

1051
01:00:54,010 --> 01:00:56,030
Lee, he's just like Guy used to be.

1052
01:00:58,830 --> 01:01:00,090
Good luck, Naruto!

1053
01:01:00,330 --> 01:01:01,330
Do your best!

1054
01:01:01,610 --> 01:01:02,910
You know it, Sakura!

1055
01:01:03,990 --> 01:01:05,490
It's your moment, Naruto.

1056
01:01:06,250 --> 01:01:07,710
Go on, show us.

1057
01:01:08,190 --> 01:01:09,890
Show us how much you've grown.

1058
01:01:13,030 --> 01:01:14,510
It's my time to shine!

1059
01:01:15,730 --> 01:01:17,130
Now, the seventh match.

1060
01:01:18,130 --> 01:01:20,450
Naruto Uzumaki and Kiba Inuzuka.

1061
01:01:22,634 --> 01:01:24,630
I've been waiting forever for this!

1062
01:01:25,190 --> 01:01:26,050
Sorry, Kiba.

1063
01:01:26,170 --> 01:01:28,330
Don't take it personally if I blow you
away.

1064
01:01:29,810 --> 01:01:32,970
That's just what I was going to say,
only not so politely.

1065
01:01:33,390 --> 01:01:34,390
Right, Akamaru?

1066
01:01:36,090 --> 01:01:36,710
Oh, yeah?

1067
01:01:36,850 --> 01:01:37,850
Well, talking's easy!

1068
01:01:38,375 --> 01:01:40,615
Let's see what you've got to say at the
end of the match!

1069
01:01:41,470 --> 01:01:42,470
Little squirt!

1070
01:01:43,690 --> 01:01:45,130
Wait a second, are you kidding me?

1071
01:01:45,170 --> 01:01:46,350
What's the puppy doing here?

1072
01:01:46,470 --> 01:01:47,890
He's just going to get in the way!

1073
01:01:48,090 --> 01:01:48,910
Deal with it!

1074
01:01:48,930 --> 01:01:50,510
I never go into battle without Akamaru!

1075
01:01:51,750 --> 01:01:54,410
Come on, isn't that against the rules or
something?

1076
01:01:55,610 --> 01:01:56,090
No.

1077
01:01:56,440 --> 01:01:58,930
Like Shino's bugs, they are a part of him.

1078
01:02:00,160 --> 01:02:01,270
He is within the rules.

1079
01:02:03,650 --> 01:02:05,350
Whatever, fine with me.

1080
01:02:05,450 --> 01:02:07,250
I do my best work with a handicap.

1081
01:02:07,690 --> 01:02:07,810
Ha!

1082
01:02:08,515 --> 01:02:09,555
We'll just see about that.

1083
01:02:11,950 --> 01:02:14,210
Akamaru, you stay right here and leave all
this to me.

1084
01:02:14,710 --> 01:02:15,710
I've got it.

1085
01:02:16,930 --> 01:02:18,070
Go on, Naruto!

1086
01:02:18,410 --> 01:02:19,850
You can't lose to this jerk!

1087
01:02:21,590 --> 01:02:22,590
Sorry, Kakashi.

1088
01:02:23,330 --> 01:02:26,370
But your boy doesn't stand a chance
against Kiba.

1089
01:02:26,870 --> 01:02:27,930
Not a chance.

1090
01:02:29,210 --> 01:02:30,390
Kiba's on my team.

1091
01:02:30,690 --> 01:02:32,390
I should be rooting for him.

1092
01:02:32,790 --> 01:02:34,970
But I really want to support Naruto.

1093
01:02:35,490 --> 01:02:36,490
Aw, man!

1094
01:02:36,890 --> 01:02:38,070
Kiba's so lucky!

1095
01:02:41,910 --> 01:02:44,930
When you're ready, you can begin.

1096
01:02:46,490 --> 01:02:49,910
Ninja art of beast mimicry all forced you
to!

1097
01:02:54,790 --> 01:02:55,790
