while.

1099
01:03:03,750 --> 01:03:05,270
You can call the match.

1100
01:03:05,730 --> 01:03:06,890
Thought as much.

1101
01:03:07,170 --> 01:03:10,010
Yeah, I thought Kiba might be too much for
him, but that was fast!

1102
01:03:10,410 --> 01:03:11,410
Oh, Naruto!

1103
01:03:11,590 --> 01:03:13,150
That was embarrassing!

1104
01:03:15,050 --> 01:03:15,730
See?

1105
01:03:15,970 --> 01:03:16,970
Told you.

1106
01:03:17,150 --> 01:03:18,190
What was that?

1107
01:03:18,530 --> 01:03:20,390
I blinked and it was over.

1108
01:03:20,550 --> 01:03:21,750
That kid's pitiful.

1109
01:03:23,690 --> 01:03:24,690
Don't ever...

1110
01:03:26,065 --> 01:03:28,770
Don't ever... Underestimate me!

1111
01:03:34,570 --> 01:03:36,710
The kid's come a long way.

1112
01:03:37,330 --> 01:03:39,310
Yeah, yeah, more tough talk!

1113
01:03:39,570 --> 01:03:40,970
Look at yourself in a mirror!

1114
01:03:41,070 --> 01:03:41,710
You're a mess!

1115
01:03:41,711 --> 01:03:42,730
Ha!

1116
01:03:42,870 --> 01:03:44,770
I just wanted to see what you've got!

1117
01:03:45,090 --> 01:03:46,950
Frankly, you hit like an old lady!

1118
01:03:48,470 --> 01:03:53,411
You have a better chance of winning this
if you send that puppy in to fight for you!

1119
01:03:53,770 --> 01:03:55,450
You're gonna regret that.

1120
01:03:56,490 --> 01:03:57,770
Come on, Akamaru!

1121
01:04:03,790 --> 01:04:04,830
Smoke grenades?

1122
01:04:05,210 --> 01:04:06,210
Take this!

1123
01:04:07,130 --> 01:04:08,130
I just want to...

1124
01:04:21,350 --> 01:04:22,550
This sucks!

1125
01:04:22,810 --> 01:04:24,250
I can't see a thing!

1126
01:04:24,510 --> 01:04:26,930
Gotta get out of this smoke and fast!

1127
01:04:28,670 --> 01:04:29,890
Have courage!

1128
01:04:38,270 --> 01:04:39,270
Yeah!

1129
01:04:39,350 --> 01:04:40,590
This fight is over!

1130
01:04:42,070 --> 01:04:43,510
Good doggy!

1131
01:04:43,695 --> 01:04:44,695
Way to...

1132
01:04:47,470 --> 01:04:48,990
Hey, Akamaru.

1133
01:04:49,130 --> 01:04:50,690
What are you doing?

1134
01:04:52,730 --> 01:04:55,630
You used a transformation jutsu!

1135
01:04:55,790 --> 01:04:57,730
You little... Get off!

1136
01:04:57,890 --> 01:04:58,950
Let go of me!

1137
01:05:00,830 --> 01:05:02,890
You smell even worse than the dog!

1138
01:05:04,090 --> 01:05:05,110
What'd you do with him?

1139
01:05:05,150 --> 01:05:05,610
Where is he?

1140
01:05:05,750 --> 01:05:06,750
He's right here!

1141
01:05:07,830 --> 01:05:08,890
How did you...

1142
01:05:10,030 --> 01:05:14,530
Okay... To balance a transformation
jutsu and a clone jutsu at the same time?

1143
01:05:14,890 --> 01:05:16,930
There's no way he should be able to do
that.

1144
01:05:17,810 --> 01:05:20,650
He's got his jutsu down, there's no doubt
about it.

1145
01:05:20,870 --> 01:05:21,590
Well, well.

1146
01:05:21,830 --> 01:05:23,170
Kid's better than I thought.

1147
01:05:23,730 --> 01:05:24,770
Wasn't that amazing?

1148
01:05:25,810 --> 01:05:26,290
Amazing!

1149
01:05:26,291 --> 01:05:27,450
That was amazing, Naruto!

1150
01:05:27,451 --> 01:05:28,451
Hehe!

1151
01:05:29,210 --> 01:05:30,230
What do you know?

1152
01:05:30,690 --> 01:05:32,590
I've gotten a little stronger,
I see.

1153
01:05:33,350 --> 01:05:35,090
But not nearly strong enough.

1154
01:05:35,330 --> 01:05:36,730
Because now I'm getting serious!

1155
01:05:37,310 --> 01:05:37,670
Oh?

1156
01:05:37,890 --> 01:05:38,590
Well, good!

1157
01:05:38,870 --> 01:05:42,550
I was hoping you would, because I want to
seriously knock you out!

1158
01:05:42,850 --> 01:05:42,930
Huh?

1159
01:05:43,110 --> 01:05:44,110
Ow!

1160
01:05:47,130 --> 01:05:48,130
Grrrr!

1161
01:05:49,390 --> 01:05:49,910
Grrrr!

1162
01:05:49,970 --> 01:05:50,970
Grrrr!

1163
01:05:52,570 --> 01:05:53,570
Grrrr!

1164
01:05:53,870 --> 01:05:54,390
Grrrr!

1165
01:05:54,391 --> 01:05:54,690
Grrrr!

1166
01:05:54,691 --> 01:05:55,070
Grrrr!

1167
01:05:55,071 --> 01:05:55,290
Grrrr!

1168
01:05:55,291 --> 01:05:55,470
Grrrr!

1169
01:05:55,471 --> 01:05:56,471
Grrrr!

1170
01:05:57,210 --> 01:05:58,270
What the heck happened?

1171
01:05:58,430 --> 01:05:59,950
What was that thing you fed him?

1172
01:06:00,210 --> 01:06:02,330
How come all his fur just turned red?

1173
01:06:02,470 --> 01:06:04,890
Are you sure you want to stick around to
find out?

1174
01:06:06,210 --> 01:06:06,490
Hmm.

1175
01:06:07,030 --> 01:06:08,030
Food pills.

1176
01:06:08,490 --> 01:06:09,490
That's it.

1177
01:06:09,710 --> 01:06:11,370
Kiba's going in for the kill.

1178
01:06:12,750 --> 01:06:14,090
Let's go, Akamaru!

1179
01:06:16,590 --> 01:06:17,710
Waste mimicry!

1180
01:06:20,130 --> 01:06:21,450
Man-piece clones!

1181
01:06:25,710 --> 01:06:28,230
He's got a crazy look in his eyes all of a
sudden.

1182
01:06:28,310 --> 01:06:29,370
Hey, wait a second!

1183
01:06:29,410 --> 01:06:30,030
He took something!

1184
01:06:30,350 --> 01:06:30,910
No fair!

1185
01:06:31,030 --> 01:06:31,590
That's cheating!

1186
01:06:31,710 --> 01:06:32,830
He ought to be disqualified!

1187
01:06:33,370 --> 01:06:33,930
Food pills.

1188
01:06:34,230 --> 01:06:35,610
They're just another tool.

1189
01:06:35,750 --> 01:06:36,750
They're allowed.

1190
01:06:37,910 --> 01:06:38,430
Ah!

1191
01:06:38,710 --> 01:06:39,950
You're no help at all!

1192
01:06:39,951 --> 01:06:40,951
Now!

1193
01:06:53,070 --> 01:06:57,540
We're not beyond balance!

1194
01:06:57,680 --> 01:06:59,040
I can't counterattack!

1195
01:06:59,660 --> 01:07:01,980
All I can do is try to keep up my feet!

1196
01:07:02,120 --> 01:07:03,500
And stay out of their way!

1197
01:07:09,020 --> 01:07:10,020
Man-piece!

1198
01:07:10,300 --> 01:07:11,560
Ultimate Taijutsu!

1199
01:07:14,680 --> 01:07:16,760
Bang over bang!

1200
01:07:25,440 --> 01:07:30,970
I told you it was gonna get serious!

1201
01:07:36,270 --> 01:07:42,450
I will... I will be... Hokage!

1202
01:07:42,610 --> 01:07:43,610
I will!

1203
01:07:45,610 --> 01:07:47,050
How you gonna do that?

1204
01:07:47,230 --> 01:07:48,930
By lying flat on your face?

1205
01:07:50,470 --> 01:07:52,510
I got news for ya!

1206
01:07:52,810 --> 01:07:54,390
I'm gonna be Hokage!

1207
01:07:59,150 --> 01:08:00,150
Transform!

1208
01:08:05,030 --> 01:08:08,050
You've been here three years and can't do
a decent transformation?

1209
01:08:08,790 --> 01:08:09,990
It won't be fun!

1210
01:08:10,210 --> 01:08:12,610
I don't have to pretend to be Hokage!

1211
01:08:12,790 --> 01:08:13,810
You just wait!

1212
01:08:13,811 --> 01:08:16,210
Someday I'm gonna be Hokage for real!

1213
01:08:16,310 --> 01:08:17,370
Then you'll be sorry!

1214
01:08:20,970 --> 01:08:21,529
Ha!

1215
01:08:21,689 --> 01:08:22,510
You're right!

1216
01:08:22,689 --> 01:08:23,770
On what planet?

1217
01:08:25,870 --> 01:08:26,930
Come on!

1218
01:08:26,990 --> 01:08:30,029
Do you really believe a weakling like you
can be Hokage?

1219
01:08:30,370 --> 01:08:32,189
You must be weak in the head!

1220
01:08:33,630 --> 01:08:34,189
No...

1221
01:08:34,550 --> 01:08:35,550
You're wrong, Shiba!

1222
01:08:36,770 --> 01:08:37,770
No...

1223
01:08:38,410 --> 01:08:39,410
You're wrong, Shiba!

1224
01:08:39,729 --> 01:08:40,729
No...

1225
01:08:43,130 --> 01:08:44,130
You're wrong, Shiba!

1226
01:08:45,450 --> 01:08:47,729
I'm gonna make sure you don't get up
again!

1227
01:08:48,050 --> 01:08:49,210
I won't wait any longer!

1228
01:08:49,630 --> 01:08:50,630
I'll show you...

1229
01:08:50,810 --> 01:08:51,450
That's it!

1230
01:08:51,451 --> 01:08:52,451
I got you!

1231
01:09:03,090 --> 01:09:04,390
Now you're done!

1232
01:09:09,990 --> 01:09:10,990
Ok!

1233
01:09:13,189 --> 01:09:13,710
I'm gonna make sure you don't get up
again!

1234
01:09:13,711 --> 01:09:15,970
Gotta find a way to counter-attack!

1235
01:09:18,550 --> 01:09:21,410
Problem is, I don't know which one to
attack!

1236
01:09:21,810 --> 01:09:23,490
Which one's the real Kiva?

1237
01:09:24,050 --> 01:09:25,609
I can't tell them apart!

1238
01:09:26,109 --> 01:09:27,630
Wait a second, that's it!

1239
01:09:30,830 --> 01:09:31,830
Transform!

1240
01:09:35,350 --> 01:09:36,430
Very clever.

1241
01:09:44,490 --> 01:09:48,210
Okay, so I see you've gotten better at the
transformation jutsu.

1242
01:09:48,590 --> 01:09:50,810
But I still know which one is you.

1243
01:09:51,330 --> 01:09:52,970
You can't hide from me!

1244
01:09:53,229 --> 01:09:54,229
Wanna know why?

1245
01:09:57,590 --> 01:09:59,150
I can smell ya, kid.

1246
01:09:59,690 --> 01:10:02,390
There's just no getting past our sense of
smell.

1247
01:10:02,770 --> 01:10:03,770
Tough luck.

1248
01:10:06,750 --> 01:10:07,750
No way!

1249
01:10:08,320 --> 01:10:09,320
It's impossible!

1250
01:10:09,410 --> 01:10:10,410
I can't believe it!

1251
01:10:10,870 --> 01:10:12,090
So it's you!

1252
01:10:13,790 --> 01:10:14,790
Messing with me!

1253
01:10:24,570 --> 01:10:25,570
Atta boy!

1254
01:10:32,010 --> 01:10:33,210
Little squirt.

1255
01:10:33,310 --> 01:10:37,070
The smart shinobi is careful how he uses
his jutsu.

1256
01:10:37,330 --> 01:10:40,350
Otherwise it's liable to come back and
bite him on the butt.

1257
01:10:40,510 --> 01:10:41,510
Dummy!

1258
01:10:43,370 --> 01:10:44,850
Hey, that's my line.

1259
01:10:45,550 --> 01:10:46,550
Sort of.

1260
01:10:47,570 --> 01:10:49,650
Arguing with this kid is a waste of
energy.

1261
01:10:49,910 --> 01:10:51,390
I can't play his game.

1262
01:10:51,730 --> 01:10:52,870
Gotta keep calm.

1263
01:10:56,050 --> 01:10:57,050
Keep calm.

1264
01:11:00,310 --> 01:11:01,830
I still have the advantage.

1265
01:11:02,370 --> 01:11:04,090
I'm a lot faster than he is.

1266
01:11:04,210 --> 01:11:05,710
He can't keep up with me.

1267
