All I have to do is watch
for an opening, slip in

1268
01:11:10,897 --> 01:11:13,971
behind, and take him
down with my all-fours jutsu!

1269
01:11:15,430 --> 01:11:18,470
So, are you finally getting serious,
Kiba?

1270
01:11:18,770 --> 01:11:19,770
Good!

1271
01:11:20,370 --> 01:11:24,190
That means it's time to unveil something
special I've been saving!

1272
01:11:24,390 --> 01:11:26,210
My super secret killer move!

1273
01:11:26,610 --> 01:11:26,770
Ha!

1274
01:11:26,970 --> 01:11:28,830
Super secret killer move!

1275
01:11:29,070 --> 01:11:29,950
Get out of here!

1276
01:11:30,070 --> 01:11:30,650
It's a bluff!

1277
01:11:31,030 --> 01:11:32,030
Yeah?

1278
01:11:32,120 --> 01:11:33,930
Well, try me and find out!

1279
01:11:34,175 --> 01:11:35,290
Go for it!

1280
01:11:37,450 --> 01:11:38,470
Too late!

1281
01:11:39,190 --> 01:11:40,570
I got you now!

1282
01:11:42,450 --> 01:11:43,450
Gah!

1283
01:11:49,690 --> 01:11:54,570
And with his sense of smell a thousand
times more sensitive than average...

1284
01:11:56,710 --> 01:11:57,710
Nasty!

1285
01:11:58,430 --> 01:12:00,050
Whatever works, Naruto!

1286
01:12:00,530 --> 01:12:02,450
You slowed him down, at least!

1287
01:12:02,950 --> 01:12:05,470
I wish I could say I planned it!

1288
01:12:05,670 --> 01:12:07,230
Shadow clone jutsu!

1289
01:12:10,570 --> 01:12:12,330
You kicked me around pretty good so far!

1290
01:12:12,490 --> 01:12:14,190
Now it's payback time!

1291
01:12:16,030 --> 01:12:17,030
Gah!

1292
01:12:17,490 --> 01:12:18,490
Gah!

1293
01:12:22,300 --> 01:12:22,630
No!

1294
01:12:22,950 --> 01:12:23,950
No!

1295
01:12:24,590 --> 01:12:25,590
Gah!

1296
01:12:30,130 --> 01:12:30,790
What?

1297
01:12:31,090 --> 01:12:32,530
Who's about to get you?

1298
01:12:32,531 --> 01:12:33,531
Gah!

1299
01:12:49,380 --> 01:12:54,260
The winner is... Naruto Uzumaki.

1300
01:12:55,180 --> 01:12:56,180
Woohoo!

1301
01:12:57,060 --> 01:12:58,320
Yes, Naruto!

1302
01:12:58,760 --> 01:12:59,860
That's my teammate!

1303
01:13:00,220 --> 01:13:01,220
Way to go!

1304
01:13:02,160 --> 01:13:03,160
Unbelievable!

1305
01:13:03,400 --> 01:13:04,960
Who would have thought he could beat Kiba?

1306
01:13:04,961 --> 01:13:07,100
A major upset.

1307
01:13:15,520 --> 01:13:22,140
It was nothing!

1308
01:13:22,380 --> 01:13:23,380
Piece of cake!

1309
01:13:25,180 --> 01:13:26,360
He's coming!

1310
01:13:26,620 --> 01:13:27,920
