1317
01:13:57,330 --> 01:14:00,770
Well, well... Uh,
what's, uh, this?

1318
01:14:02,090 --> 01:14:03,550
It's a healing ointment.

1319
01:14:04,660 --> 01:14:05,230
For me?

1320
01:14:05,310 --> 01:14:06,310
What for?

1321
01:14:08,130 --> 01:14:09,470
Take it, Naruto.

1322
01:14:09,730 --> 01:14:10,730
Go ahead.

1323
01:14:11,990 --> 01:14:12,990
Hmm...

1324
01:14:14,010 --> 01:14:14,670
Hmph.

1325
01:14:14,850 --> 01:14:15,850
Thanks, Hinata.

1326
01:14:15,950 --> 01:14:17,690
That's, uh, real nice of you.

1327
01:14:21,750 --> 01:14:24,310
You have nothing to be ashamed of,
Kiba.

