01:14:24,990 --> 01:14:28,270
Who could have imagined he would be such a
strong opponent?

1329
01:14:32,100 --> 01:14:33,100
...

1330
01:14:36,140 --> 01:14:37,821
... ...

1331
01:14:43,390 --> 01:14:44,640
Silly Hinata.

1332
01:14:44,820 --> 01:14:46,780
Not a care in the world.

1333
01:14:47,580 --> 01:14:51,121
... ... ... ...

1334
01:14:52,020 --> 01:14:52,720
Whoa!

1335
01:14:52,940 --> 01:14:55,060
This stuff Hinata gave me works fast!

1336
01:14:56,740 --> 01:14:57,740
Here!

1337
01:14:58,175 --> 01:14:59,175
Wanna try it, Sakura?

1338
01:14:59,580 --> 01:15:00,580
Hmm?

1339
01:15:01,640 --> 01:15:04,380
Only your wounds will heal that quickly,
Naruto.

1340
01:15:04,740 --> 01:15:06,260
It's not the ointment.

1341
01:15:06,300 --> 01:15:08,760
It's the power of the Nine-Tailed Fox.

1342
01:15:09,100 --> 01:15:11,600
It never ceases to surprise me.

1343
01:15:18,680 --> 01:15:19,880
K-Kiba?

1344
01:15:24,820 --> 01:15:27,960
Here... here's some... healing ointment.

1345
01:15:28,770 --> 01:15:30,300
It's for you and Hakamaru.

1346
01:15:30,860 --> 01:15:31,860
Heh.

1347
01:15:32,010 --> 01:15:32,980
Forget about us.

1348
01:15:33,000 --> 01:15:35,160
You better start worrying about yourself,
Hinata.

1349
01:15:36,195 --> 01:15:37,195
Only six left.

1350
01:15:37,720 --> 01:15:40,340
Just you and Choji, Neji, Lee...

1351
01:15:40,590 --> 01:15:43,360
And then there are those two guys from the
Sound and Sand Villages.

1352
01:15:44,780 --> 01:15:45,780
Listen to me.

1353
01:15:45,950 --> 01:15:46,950
Be smart.

1354
01:15:48,620 --> 01:15:51,900
If they put you in with that guy from the
Sand Village...

1355
01:15:52,750 --> 01:15:54,220
You've got to forfeit the match.

1356
01:15:55,040 --> 01:15:56,040
...

1357
01:16:00,480 --> 01:16:01,480
Hinata...

1358
01:16:02,860 --> 01:16:03,460
Hmm.

1359
01:16:03,461 --> 01:16:06,140
This should be an interesting match
indeed.

1360
01:16:15,400 --> 01:16:19,780
I never thought that you and I would have
to face each other, Hinata.

1361
01:16:20,960 --> 01:16:22,100
Nor I, brother.

1362
01:16:22,460 --> 01:16:23,640
What'd she call him?

1363
01:16:23,800 --> 01:16:27,740
They're both descended from the Hyuga
Clan, one of the most ancient and

1364
01:16:27,741 --> 01:16:29,880
honorable families of the Hidden Leaf
Village.

1365
01:16:30,120 --> 01:16:31,860
Not actually brother and sister.

1366
01:16:32,720 --> 01:16:35,200
Okay, but they're related somehow,
right?

1367
01:16:35,560 --> 01:16:36,560
Yes.

1368
01:16:36,660 --> 01:16:39,323
Hinata belongs to the
family's main household,

1369
01:16:39,324 --> 01:16:41,500
directly descended
from the head of the clan.

1370
01:16:41,720 --> 01:16:44,920
While Neji's family is just a side branch
of the clan.

1371
01:16:45,360 --> 01:16:48,260
Still, they're family, and now they have
to fight each other.

1372
01:16:48,860 --> 01:16:50,240
I feel for them.

1373
01:16:50,320 --> 01:16:51,320
Must be hard.

1374
01:16:51,400 --> 01:16:53,060
It may not be as hard as it seems.

1375
01:16:53,200 --> 01:16:55,458
I have heard that for
many generations now there

1376
01:16:55,459 --> 01:16:58,321
has been some bad blood
between the two families.

1377
01:16:59,200 --> 01:17:00,060
All right.

1378
01:17:00,200 --> 01:17:01,740
You may begin when ready.

1379
01:17:02,870 --> 01:17:05,100
Before we do this, a word of advice.

1380
01:17:06,360 --> 01:17:07,880
Hinata, listen to me.

1381
01:17:09,240 --> 01:17:10,240
Withdraw now.

1382
01:17:11,010 --> 01:17:12,900
You know you were never meant to be a
ninja.

1383
01:17:14,520 --> 01:17:16,340
You're too kind and gentle.

1384
01:17:16,890 --> 01:17:19,160
You seek harmony and avoid conflict.

1385
01:17:19,300 --> 01:17:20,800
You have no confidence.

1386
01:17:21,730 --> 01:17:23,940
You feel inferior to everyone else here.

1387
01:17:24,610 --> 01:17:27,360
It would have been better for you to
simply remain a genin.

1388
01:17:27,955 --> 01:17:31,380
But to register for the Chunin exams,
you need a team of three people.

1389
01:17:32,135 --> 01:17:36,140
You never even wanted to take part in
these exams, but Shino and Kiba did.

1390
01:17:36,545 --> 01:17:38,660
And you couldn't bear to let your
teammates down.

1391
01:17:39,300 --> 01:17:40,300
Could you?

1392
01:17:40,460 --> 01:17:40,900
No!

1393
01:17:41,360 --> 01:17:42,040
You're wrong!

1394
01:17:42,200 --> 01:17:43,200
You're wrong!

1395
01:17:44,040 --> 01:17:46,820
I wanted... I had to find out...

1396
01:17:48,170 --> 01:17:50,700
I did it because I wanted to see if I
could change.

1397
01:17:51,280 --> 01:17:53,840
People can't change no matter how hard
they try.

1398
01:17:55,360 --> 01:17:57,980
They can't run away from their true
nature.

1399
01:17:58,140 --> 01:18:01,040
A failure will always be a failure.

1400
01:18:03,040 --> 01:18:08,800
I understand these things because I see
the world clearly with my Byakugan.

1401
01:18:09,760 --> 01:18:14,000
Despite your brave words, what you're
really thinking is that you'd like to run.

1402
01:18:14,180 --> 01:18:16,460
Run as far away from here as you can.

1403
01:18:16,900 --> 01:18:17,360
No!

1404
01:18:17,560 --> 01:18:18,300
You're wrong!

1405
01:18:18,460 --> 01:18:19,880
You're wrong about me!

1406
01:18:20,660 --> 01:18:21,260
Byakugan?

1407
01:18:21,460 --> 01:18:25,060
It's the kekegenkai or bloodline trait of
the Hyuga.

1408
01:18:25,220 --> 01:18:28,240
A visual jutsu like Sasuke's Sharingan.

1409
01:18:34,400 --> 01:18:35,120
You're wrong.

1410
01:18:35,121 --> 01:18:36,121
Byakugan!

1411
01:18:47,480 --> 01:18:48,480
Byakugan!

1412
01:18:48,720 --> 01:18:52,254
Just one moment ago, in the
slightest of movements, your

1413
01:18:52,255 --> 01:18:55,000
gaze drifted toward the
upper left corner of the room.

1414
01:18:55,960 --> 01:18:59,780
I saw, at that moment, you were thinking
of your past.

1415
01:18:59,781 --> 01:19:01,480
Your bitter past.

1416
01:19:02,360 --> 01:19:06,660
And then, almost immediately after,
your gaze drifted to the lower right.

1417
01:19:06,980 --> 01:19:09,638
It was a mere flicker
of the eyes, but to me it

1418
01:19:09,639 --> 01:19:12,200
revealed all of your mental
and physical suffering.

1419
01:19:12,880 --> 01:19:14,560
You're seeing your old self.

1420
01:19:14,880 --> 01:19:18,040
And wondering if your life has prepared
you for this moment.

1421
01:19:18,520 --> 01:19:21,020
You're picturing the outcome of the
battle.

1422
01:19:22,100 --> 01:19:24,060
You see yourself losing.

1423
01:19:26,760 --> 01:19:30,660
And the way you're holding your arms in
front of your body like that?

1424
01:19:31,680 --> 01:19:34,820
It tells me that you're trying to build a
wall between us.

1425
01:19:35,120 --> 01:19:36,560
To keep me at bay.

1426
01:19:37,920 --> 01:19:39,200
Shall we go on?

1427
01:19:40,080 --> 01:19:43,480
That familiar gesture of putting your
finger to your lips.

1428
01:19:43,860 --> 01:19:47,460
I know that it's a desperate attempt to
suppress your rising panic.

1429
01:19:48,020 --> 01:19:51,340
Made all the more desperate because you
know it's futile.

1430
01:19:52,900 --> 01:19:56,540
Whether you admit it or not, you already
know.

1431
01:19:57,060 --> 01:19:58,160
That does it!

1432
01:20:00,860 --> 01:20:04,020
Who gave you the right to tell her what
she can or can't be?

1433
01:20:04,320 --> 01:20:05,460
Go on, Hinata!

1434
01:20:05,580 --> 01:20:06,780
Show this guy he's wrong!

1435
01:20:08,320 --> 01:20:10,040
You're just gonna stand there and take
that?

1436
01:20:10,220 --> 01:20:11,020
Do something!

1437
01:20:11,200 --> 01:20:12,300
You're driving me crazy!

1438
01:20:16,520 --> 01:20:17,720
Annoying little test.

1439
01:20:24,530 --> 01:20:25,710
You're right, Naruto.

1440
01:20:28,270 --> 01:20:29,270
Thank you.

1441
01:20:33,050 --> 01:20:34,910
The look in her eye has changed.

1442
01:20:36,330 --> 01:20:39,910
If you don't forfeit the match,
you know what will happen.

1443
01:20:40,850 --> 01:20:42,230
I won't run away!

1444
01:20:42,650 --> 01:20:43,450
No way!

1445
01:20:43,530 --> 01:20:45,150
I never go back on my word!

1446
01:20:45,350 --> 01:20:46,870
That's the way of the ninja!

1447
01:20:48,110 --> 01:20:49,530
No more hiding!

1448
01:20:50,170 --> 01:20:51,310
The other side!

1449
01:21:08,210 --> 01:21:09,810
Very well, then.

1450
01:21:13,570 --> 01:21:16,875
I have on my team the man
who is probably the strongest

1451
01:21:16,876 --> 01:21:19,310
genin ever to come out
of the Hidden Leaf Village.

1452
01:21:19,910 --> 01:21:20,910
That man.

1453
01:21:21,710 --> 01:21:22,990
Neji Hyuga.

1454
01:21:25,670 --> 01:21:26,670
Neji Hyuga.

1455
01:21:30,830 --> 01:21:31,470
Neji Hyuga.

1456
01:21:31,471 --> 01:21:31,830
Neji Hyuga.

1457
01:21:31,831 --> 01:21:32,390
Neji Hyuga.

1458
01:21:32,391 --> 01:21:33,391
Neji Hyuga.

1459
01:21:34,035 --> 01:21:35,290
Neji Hyuga.

1460
01:21:38,490 --> 01:21:39,490
...

1461
01:21:46,849 --> 01:21:47,660
This is the man!

1462
01:21:47,661 --> 01:21:48,796
And this is the man who will bring the
power of the Did she get him?

1463
01:21:48,820 --> 01:21:49,560
No way!

1464
01:21:49,780 --> 01:21:51,080
She hardly touched him!

1465
01:21:51,220 --> 01:21:53,700
Even so, a glancing blow is enough.

1466
01:21:54,260 --> 01:21:58,460
That is what makes the Hyuga clan the most
formidable of fighters.

1467
01:21:58,820 --> 01:21:59,500
What does?

1468
01:21:59,780 --> 01:22:00,960
What are you talking about?

1469
01:22:01,240 --> 01:22:05,540
Their Taijutsu is a unique one that's been
passed down for generations.

1470
01:22:05,541 --> 01:22:08,900
It's not the kind of taijutsu Lee and I
employ.

1471
01:22:09,340 --> 01:22:12,680
We tend to concentrate on inflicting
external damage.

1472
01:22:13,040 --> 01:22:18,160
We use crushing blows to raise contusions
and break limbs, pounding our enemy.

1473
01:22:18,760 --> 01:22:22,133
The Hugo way is to attack
their opponent's internal organs

1474
01:22:22,134 --> 01:22:25,140
and the chakra network
through which the chakra flows.

1475
01:22:25,660 --> 01:22:28,080
Their way is more... subtle.

1476
01:22:28,600 --> 01:22:30,660
Perhaps not as thrilling to watch.

1477
01:22:30,661 --> 01:22:34,960
But it gradually takes effect,
with devastating results.

1478
01:22:36,840 --> 01:22:40,200
But Sensei, how do they know where to
strike their opponent?

1479
01:22:40,880 --> 01:22:44,740
I mean, the chakra network is invisible to
the eye, right?

1480
01:22:45,020 --> 01:22:47,880
So how do they know exactly where to land
their blows?

1481
01:22:48,680 --> 01:22:50,760
You're forgetting their Byakugan.

1482
01:22:51,080 --> 01:22:54,260
There are few things invisible to those
eyes.

1483
01:23:00,660 --> 01:23:04,820
What's more, when they strike a blow, it's
a little different from a normal attack.

1484
01:23:05,420 --> 01:23:10,140
A small but intense burst of their own
chakra is released from their hand.

1485
01:23:10,440 --> 01:23:15,320
It drills into the opponent's body,
directly attacking his chakra network.

1486
01:23:17,620 --> 01:23:18,220
Yeah!

1487
01:23:18,320 --> 01:23:19,320
Get him!

1488
01:23:24,300 --> 01:23:25,700
So that's it, huh?

1489
01:23:26,040 --> 01:23:28,520
That's all there is to the main branch's
power?

1490
01:23:29,480 --> 01:23:31,320
Wait, what is going on?

1491
01:23:31,380 --> 01:23:33,720
I mean, I saw Hinata hit Neji perfectly!

1492
01:23:34,200 --> 01:23:35,440
I'm not done yet.

1493
01:23:39,260 --> 01:23:40,640
What's with this kid?

1494
01:23:46,200 --> 01:23:50,701
But... you mean... all this
time you... That's right.

1495
01:23:50,780 --> 01:23:53,420
I could see your chakra points the whole
time.

1496
01:23:53,820 --> 01:23:54,000
Huh?

1497
01:23:54,240 --> 01:23:55,520
What is he talking about?

1498
01:23:56,180 --> 01:23:58,280
On the chakra network, there are...

1499
01:23:58,520 --> 01:23:58,760
Chakra points.

1500
01:23:59,160 --> 01:24:02,060
And each are only about the size of the
head of a pin.

1501
01:24:02,340 --> 01:24:07,680
Hitting one directly can affect chakra
flow, either halting it or increasing it,

1502
01:24:07,740 --> 01:24:10,540
depending on how the attacker strikes the
chakra points.

1503
01:24:12,100 --> 01:24:14,612
Theoretically, doing
so allows a ninja to gain

1504
01:24:14,613 --> 01:24:17,721
complete control over
an opponent's chakra flow.

1505
01:24:18,100 --> 01:24:23,080
But these chakra points... they're
undetectable even to my Sharingan eye.

1506
01:24:24,100 --> 01:24:27,305
And even beyond his ability
to see the chakra points, he

1507
01:24:27,306 --> 01:24:30,420
can target them accurately,
even during intense battle.

1508
01:24:35,385 --> 01:24:36,780
Look, Hinata.

1509
01:24:37,530 --> 01:24:39,900
I'm completely out of your league,
and that won't change.

1510
01:24:40,895 --> 01:24:43,380
You may not like it, but it's a fact.

1511
01:24:43,820 --> 01:24:47,860
From the instant you said you wouldn't run
anymore, your fate was sealed.

1512
01:24:47,940 --> 01:24:49,480
You were destined for failure.

1513
01:24:50,845 --> 01:24:51,940
Forfeit this match.

1514
01:24:54,000 --> 01:24:58,780
I... I never...

1515
01:25:02,680 --> 01:25:03,840
Go... back...

1516
01:25:06,700 --> 01:25:08,400
On... my word.

1517
01:25:08,800 --> 01:25:10,460
I'm not going to run away!

1518
01:25:11,940 --> 01:25:16,120
Because that, too, is my nindo... my ninja
way.

1519
01:25:19,400 --> 01:25:23,480
I had no idea... that Hinata's as tough as
she is.

1520
01:25:23,620 --> 01:25:24,840
She is a lot like you.

1521
01:25:26,170 --> 01:25:29,720
You know, come to think of it... she is
always watching you.

1522
01:25:29,721 --> 01:25:30,721
Huh?

1523
01:25:34,780 --> 01:25:35,780
Hinata!

1524
01:25:45,650 --> 01:25:47,610
She has reached her limit.

1525
01:25:48,610 --> 01:25:50,730
One more blow, and she's done.

1526
01:25:52,190 --> 01:25:52,830
Go, Hinata!

1527
01:25:53,070 --> 01:25:54,390
You can do it!

1528
01:25:58,350 --> 01:25:59,350
Naruto...

1529
01:26:00,910 --> 01:26:02,810
Strength has come back into her eyes.

1530
01:26:05,530 --> 01:26:06,650
I've been watching you.

1531
01:26:12,410 --> 01:26:15,450
I've been watching you closely for many
years now.

1532
01:26:20,090 --> 01:26:21,450
I wonder why.

1533
01:26:26,530 --> 01:26:29,790
When I watch you, I feel full of courage.

1534
01:26:30,870 --> 01:26:32,830
I feel that I can keep going.

1535
01:26:32,831 --> 01:26:34,450
That I can succeed.

1536
01:26:35,830 --> 01:26:37,930
That even I am worth something.

1537
01:26:43,870 --> 01:26:44,870
Hinata!

1538
01:26:49,870 --> 01:26:50,870
Hinata...

1539
01:26:51,760 --> 01:26:53,210
Hinata used to be a quitter.

1540
01:26:53,350 --> 01:26:55,650
But I can see that she's changed.

1541
01:26:56,890 --> 01:27:02,230
I have never seen such a look
of... of fierceness in her eyes before.

1542
01:27:02,231 --> 01:27:03,451
Hinata... Eh.

1543
01:27:03,910 --> 01:27:04,910
Not at all.

1544
01:27:05,410 --> 01:27:08,310
Until now, I have always done the
watching.

1545
01:27:09,030 --> 01:27:10,030
But...

1546
01:27:10,190 --> 01:27:11,190
Now?

1547
01:27:11,430 --> 01:27:15,410
Finally, you're the one watching me,
and I'll show you what I can do.

1548
01:27:20,280 --> 01:27:21,801
Hinata... Hinata...

1549
01:27:23,160 --> 01:27:24,160
Hinata...

1550
01:27:25,335 --> 01:27:26,981
Hinata... Hinata...

1551
01:27:29,400 --> 01:27:34,100
Hinata... And from the
very start, you're finished.

1552
01:27:40,080 --> 01:27:41,720
Hinata, you've done enough.

1553
01:27:42,280 --> 01:27:46,620
You lost the match, but you've become a
new person in the process.

1554
01:27:47,160 --> 01:27:48,280
You did great.

1555
01:27:51,620 --> 01:27:56,680
It's too bad, but after that blow to the
heart, Hinata is done.

1556
01:28:03,655 --> 01:28:06,400
Since she's no longer able
to continue this match... No!

1557
01:28:06,840 --> 01:28:08,400
Don't stop this match!

1558
01:28:08,680 --> 01:28:09,680
Naruto!

1559
01:28:10,490 --> 01:28:11,740
What on earth are you doing?

1560
01:28:12,380 --> 01:28:13,360
Hinata's had it.

1561
01:28:13,380 --> 01:28:15,620
You can see she's unconscious,
can't you?

1562
01:28:34,430 --> 01:28:36,310
What do you think you're doing?

1563
01:28:37,700 --> 01:28:40,490
If you continue to fight, you're going to
die.

1564
01:28:41,420 --> 01:28:42,420
It doesn't matter.

1565
01:28:42,670 --> 01:28:44,970
I'm not going to let myself look bad.

1566
01:28:45,330 --> 01:28:46,330
Not now.

1567
01:28:48,010 --> 01:28:50,870
Not in front of the person I admire most.

1568
01:28:51,280 --> 01:28:53,390
Who's finally seeing the real me.

1569
01:28:59,410 --> 01:29:01,690
I'm far from finished!

1570
01:29:02,530 --> 01:29:04,350
Give up the tough guy act.

1571
01:29:04,510 --> 01:29:06,270
I can tell you're barely standing.

1572
01:29:07,690 --> 01:29:10,110
You've been carrying a very heavy burden.

1573
01:29:10,111 --> 01:29:13,190
Having been born to the main branch of the
Hyuga clan.

1574
01:29:15,210 --> 01:29:16,990
No, you're wrong, brother.

1575
01:29:17,370 --> 01:29:18,710
You've got it backwards.

1576
01:29:20,050 --> 01:29:27,890
You see, I can tell... that you're the
one... you're suffering much more than I.

1577
01:29:28,190 --> 01:29:29,190
I what?

1578
01:29:29,430 --> 01:29:33,146
You're the one who's all
torn up... about the fate

1579
01:29:33,147 --> 01:29:36,471
of the main and side
branches of the Hyuga clan.

1580
01:29:37,810 --> 01:29:38,810
Grrrr!

