01:29:50,230 --> 01:29:53,410
You promised me you wouldn't let this
whole head family thing get you riled up.

1585
01:29:53,940 --> 01:29:55,970
Why are you and the other Jonin butting
in?

1586
01:29:56,640 --> 01:29:58,370
The head family gets special treatment,
huh?

1587
01:30:03,970 --> 01:30:04,450
Hinata!

1588
01:30:04,451 --> 01:30:05,451
Hinata!

1589
01:30:07,510 --> 01:30:08,690
Hinata!

1590
01:30:08,770 --> 01:30:08,770
Hinata!

1591
01:30:09,160 --> 01:30:09,770
You okay?

1592
01:30:10,110 --> 01:30:11,110
Hey!

1593
01:30:14,345 --> 01:30:21,970
Na... Naruto... do you think... I changed?

1594
01:30:23,305 --> 01:30:25,610
Maybe a little?

1595
01:30:27,950 --> 01:30:28,950
Hey, you!

1596
01:30:29,390 --> 01:30:29,970
Loser!

1597
01:30:30,390 --> 01:30:34,650
I have two pieces of advice for you.

1598
01:30:35,860 --> 01:30:38,725
First of all, if you
intend to call yourself

1599
01:30:38,726 --> 01:30:41,330
