1605
01:31:03,690 --> 01:31:06,450
Naruto, I get where you are coming from,
believe me.

1606
01:31:06,590 --> 01:31:10,550
But the rules say, all fighting must be
done officially in a match.

1607
01:31:12,110 --> 01:31:15,750
The loser beating the gifted genius
through sheer willpower.

1608
01:31:16,150 --> 01:31:18,470
Now would not that make for an exciting
match?

1609
01:31:19,230 --> 01:31:22,770
Even if, I am the one who is going to have
to fight Neji.

1610
01:31:27,210 --> 01:31:29,090
I am the one who is going to have to fight
Neji.

1611
01:31:29,330 --> 01:31:30,330
Alright, fine!

1612
01:31:30,410 --> 01:31:31,410
You win, Lee!

1613
01:31:35,300 --> 01:31:37,900
