And hurry up!

1619
01:31:48,320 --> 01:31:49,320
We're coming!

1620
01:31:52,740 --> 01:31:53,880
She has no pulse.

1621
01:31:54,000 --> 01:31:55,000
She has no pulse.

1622
01:31:55,300 --> 01:31:56,540
It's very serious.

1623
01:31:56,560 --> 01:31:57,820
She's got ten minutes
and... That's best.

1624
