1642
01:33:01,000 --> 01:33:03,100
All the short ribs you
can eat... That's a low blow.

1643
01:33:03,240 --> 01:33:04,420
Playing on his weak spot?

1644
01:33:04,440 --> 01:33:04,520
That's a low blow.

1645
01:33:04,520 --> 01:33:04,520
Playing on his weak spot?

1646
01:33:04,521 --> 01:33:07,620
When did he step in and stop the fight
anyway?

