So tell me something about this guy Neji.

1664
01:33:50,865 --> 01:33:54,460
I get the feeling we didn't see the full
extent of his powers in the last fight,

1665
01:33:54,580 --> 01:33:54,940
did we?

1666
01:33:55,400 --> 01:33:56,480
