1667
01:33:57,620 --> 01:33:59,340
I'm gonna pulverize him!

1668
01:33:59,360 --> 01:34:00,400
That's his story!

1669
01:34:03,080 --> 01:34:04,440
I'm gonna pulverize him!

1670
01:34:04,500 --> 01:34:04,500
That's his story!

1671
01:34:04,501 --> 01:34:05,501
I'm like a nice guy.

1672
