1682
01:34:36,380 --> 01:34:37,860
I might as well go last!

1683
01:34:38,500 --> 01:34:39,640
Yes sir!

1684
01:35:00,960 --> 01:35:01,540
Please take this to your Why does he have
so much power?!

1685
01:35:01,541 --> 01:35:02,541
Come back here!

1686
01:35:03,000 --> 01:35:04,100
Well, come on.

1687
01:35:04,840 --> 01:35:05,880
Let's do this.

1688
01:35:09,900 --> 01:35:10,900
Safe again!

1689
01:35:15,820 --> 01:35:17,480
It worked like a charm.

1690
01:35:17,620 --> 01:35:20,220
I knew if I said I want to be last,
I would be next.

1691
01:35:20,440 --> 01:35:23,140
I simply applied the principle
which states that sometimes

1692
01:35:23,141 --> 01:35:26,040
the surest way to hit something
is to stop trying to hit it.

1693
01:35:26,400 --> 01:35:28,380
It is a form of reverse psychology.

1694
01:35:28,381 --> 01:35:29,400
Hoo-ah!

1695
01:35:30,080 --> 01:35:31,380
