1772
01:39:10,730 --> 01:39:11,730
Ah!

1773
01:39:15,310 --> 01:39:16,310
Ah!

1774
01:39:18,210 --> 01:39:19,210
Ah!

1775
01:39:20,370 --> 01:39:21,370
Ah!

1776
01:39:21,490 --> 01:39:22,490
Ah!

1777
01:39:23,030 --> 01:39:24,030
Ah...

1778
01:39:26,130 --> 01:39:27,290
All right, Lee.

1779
01:39:27,430 --> 01:39:28,430
