1802
01:40:18,370 --> 01:40:19,370
Ah!

1803
01:40:21,930 --> 01:40:22,930
Ah!

1804
01:40:30,170 --> 01:40:30,470
Ah!

1805
01:40:30,471 --> 01:40:30,610
Ah!

1806
01:40:30,611 --> 01:40:31,611
