1807
01:40:31,770 --> 01:40:32,770
Ah!

1808
01:40:37,190 --> 01:40:41,470
I can see that Lee had no aptitude for
ninjutsu or genjutsu.

1809
01:40:41,830 --> 01:40:44,529
So he skipped them
and focused all of his

1810
01:40:44,530 --> 01:40:48,091
time and energy into
developing his taijutsu.

1811
01:40:48,390 --> 01:40:51,150
That way we turned his disadvantage into a
blessing.

1812
01:40:51,470 --> 01:40:54,350
