win.

1813
01:40:54,810 --> 01:41:00,350
Because he's transformed himself into the
world's greatest taijutsu specialist.

1814
01:41:01,110 --> 01:41:02,110
Ah!

1815
01:41:13,260 --> 01:41:15,060
I don't believe it!

1816
01:41:15,560 --> 01:41:16,700
