1830
01:41:51,600 --> 01:41:54,220
It makes me dizzy just trying to keep
track of him!

1831
01:41:54,620 --> 01:41:55,620
Hmph!

1832
01:41:56,380 --> 01:41:57,380
Hmph!

1833
01:41:57,440 --> 01:41:58,140
Hmph!

1834
01:41:58,141 --> 01:41:58,480
Hmph!

1835
01:41:58,940 --> 01:41:59,940
Hmph!

1836
01:41:59,980 --> 01:41:59,980
Hmph!

1837
01:42:00,380 --> 01:42:00,380
Hmph!

1838
01:42:00,381 --> 01:42:01,381
Hmph!

1839
01:42:04,720 --> 01:42:05,520
Hmph!

1840
01:42:05,660 --> 01:42:05,660
Hmph!

1841
01:42:05,680 --> 01:42:05,820
