01:42:38,840 --> 01:42:41,280
His inner demon has been awakened...

1852
01:42:44,100 --> 01:42:46,000
My speed will not be enough.

1853
01:42:46,260 --> 01:42:48,660
He is impossible to get at behind those
sand defenses!

1854
01:42:51,010 --> 01:42:54,780
But maybe if I can get him up off the
ground and away from the sand...

1855
01:42:54,781 --> 01:42:58,140
then hit him hard from
above... ...with the lotos.

1856
01:43:00,014 --> 01:43:01,014
Hmph!

1857
01:43:01,740 --> 01:43:02,740
Hmph!

1858
01:43:14,570 --> 01:43:15,590
Get ready!

1859
01:43:21,920 --> 01:43:23,180
That's right, Lee.

1860
01:43:23,560 --> 01:43:24,560
Good work.

1861
01:43:24,760 --> 01:43:28,380
That flimsy shield of sand won't protect
it from your high-speed lotus.

1862
01:43:30,120 --> 01:43:32,040
What are you waiting for?

1863
01:43:32,480 --> 01:43:34,100
Okay, you asked for it!

1864
01:43:36,920 --> 01:43:38,120
Try this!

1865
01:43:44,360 --> 01:43:46,180
What an incredible series of kicks.

1866
01:43:47,300 --> 01:43:51,140
Even an ordinary lotus puts an enormous
strain on the body.

1867
01:43:51,280 --> 01:43:52,520
Let alone this.

1868
01:43:52,820 --> 01:43:55,000
You've got to finish him off now!

1869
01:44:08,180 --> 01:44:10,240
Now take this!

1870
01:44:12,700 --> 01:44:13,980
Primary lotus!

1871
01:44:27,820 --> 01:44:28,820
It is over.

1872
01:44:29,165 --> 01:44:30,165
I got him!

1873
01:44:31,810 --> 01:44:32,810
Right on!

1874
01:44:33,670 --> 01:44:34,270
Amazing!

1875
01:44:34,510 --> 01:44:35,670
He really did it!

1876
01:44:35,995 --> 01:44:37,610
No, I don't believe it!

1877
01:44:38,250 --> 01:44:39,250
You did it!

1878
01:44:39,350 --> 01:44:40,530
Way to go, Lee!

1879
01:44:41,410 --> 01:44:43,850
Izzy, that guy isn't dead, is he?

1880
01:44:53,640 --> 01:44:54,760
I don't believe it!

1881
01:44:59,060 --> 01:45:00,060
But how?

1882
01:45:00,200 --> 01:45:01,320
When did he do it?

1883
01:45:01,520 --> 01:45:04,340
It was when you closed your eyes to pray.

1884
01:45:04,800 --> 01:45:05,800
Huh?

1885
01:45:08,060 --> 01:45:08,620
Huh?

1886
01:45:08,880 --> 01:45:09,360
Huh?

1887
01:45:09,660 --> 01:45:10,220
Huh?

1888
01:45:10,221 --> 01:45:10,480
Huh?

1889
01:45:10,481 --> 01:45:10,560
Huh?

1890
01:45:10,561 --> 01:45:11,561
Huh?

1891
01:45:12,160 --> 01:45:13,160
Huh?

1892
01:45:13,240 --> 01:45:14,240
Huh?

1893
01:45:15,540 --> 01:45:16,540
Ah!

1894
01:45:16,780 --> 01:45:17,780
No!

1895
01:45:18,240 --> 01:45:19,240
Ah!

1896
01:45:20,040 --> 01:45:20,480
Ah!

1897
01:45:21,020 --> 01:45:21,460
Ah!

1898
01:45:21,920 --> 01:45:22,360
Ah!

1899
01:45:22,800 --> 01:45:23,800
Ah!

1900
01:45:23,860 --> 01:45:24,860
Ah!

1901
01:45:25,000 --> 01:45:25,880
Ah!

1902
01:45:25,960 --> 01:45:26,160
Ah!

1903
01:45:26,161 --> 01:45:26,660
Ah!

1904
01:45:26,780 --> 01:45:26,980
Ah!

1905
01:45:27,460 --> 01:45:27,620
Ah!

1906
01:45:27,840 --> 01:45:28,840
Ah!

1907
01:45:29,040 --> 01:45:30,040
Ah!

1908
01:45:42,480 --> 01:45:44,220
The fourth kid is helpless.

1909
01:45:44,300 --> 01:45:45,460
He doesn't have anything left.

1910
01:45:45,461 --> 01:45:45,640
Gara's left.

1911
01:45:46,360 --> 01:45:48,280
Gara's just toying with him now.

1912
01:46:06,560 --> 01:46:08,160
Dummy, why bother?

1913
01:46:08,440 --> 01:46:09,820
You'll never be a ninja.

1914
01:46:12,040 --> 01:46:12,660
We'll do.

1915
01:46:13,020 --> 01:46:16,860
There's no way a kid who can't even do
ninjutsu can ever be a ninja.

1916
01:46:17,040 --> 01:46:17,780
Yes, I can.

1917
01:46:17,880 --> 01:46:18,180
Whatever.

1918
01:46:18,420 --> 01:46:22,240
I don't get why you're even at this ninja
academy when you can't do ninjutsu or

1919
01:46:22,241 --> 01:46:25,080
genjutsu and you're even worse than
average at taijutsu.

1920
01:46:25,120 --> 01:46:26,120
It's idiotic.

1921
01:46:26,340 --> 01:46:29,180
Hey, you know what everyone here is
calling you, don't you?

1922
01:46:30,640 --> 01:46:31,640
Dork Lee!

1923
01:46:32,120 --> 01:46:33,120
Dork Lee!

1924
01:46:33,680 --> 01:46:34,680
Dork Lee!

1925
01:46:35,660 --> 01:46:36,660
Hey Lee!

1926
01:46:36,820 --> 01:46:37,820
Where are you going?

1927
01:46:37,860 --> 01:46:38,860
Get back in line!

1928
01:46:40,700 --> 01:46:44,120
So that's the no talent overachiever I've
heard so much about.

1929
01:46:44,420 --> 01:46:47,000
Yeah, he kind of reminds me of someone.

1930
01:46:47,520 --> 01:46:50,420
Especially around the eyebrows.

1931
01:46:52,800 --> 01:46:53,840
Rock Lee.

1932
01:46:54,120 --> 01:46:58,380
The dork with nothing going for him but a
little lousy taijutsu.

1933
01:47:04,560 --> 01:47:06,840
But you kept at it, didn't you?

1934
01:47:06,940 --> 01:47:09,800
You kept practicing your little lousy
taijutsu.

1935
01:47:09,820 --> 01:47:14,100
As of today, you are all genin.

1936
01:47:14,600 --> 01:47:17,360
So now tell me, why have you done it?

1937
01:47:17,480 --> 01:47:18,640
What are your goals?

1938
01:47:19,120 --> 01:47:19,460
Hmm?

1939
01:47:19,780 --> 01:47:21,620
Oh, me me sensei, me!

1940
01:47:22,040 --> 01:47:23,100
Yes, Ten-ten.

1941
01:47:23,360 --> 01:47:26,109
I want to be a great and
powerful ninja to walk in

1942
01:47:26,110 --> 01:47:29,200
the footsteps of the
legendary kunoichi Tsunade.

1943
01:47:29,670 --> 01:47:30,670
I see.

1944
01:47:31,410 --> 01:47:32,760
How about me sensei?

1945
01:47:33,570 --> 01:47:35,900
I want to show I can be a splendid ninja
as well.

1946
01:47:36,650 --> 01:47:39,160
Even if I do not have ninjutsu or
genjutsu.

1947
01:47:40,450 --> 01:47:42,160
I want to prove it to the whole world!

1948
01:47:45,480 --> 01:47:50,280
Lee will struggle on long after the point
where anyone else would have quit.

1949
01:47:52,020 --> 01:47:56,940
If I cannot do 1,200 without a mistake,
then it is 2,000 kicks!

1950
01:47:57,340 --> 01:47:58,920
1,117!

1951
01:47:59,080 --> 01:48:00,420
1,118!

1952
01:48:00,660 --> 01:48:01,840
1,119!

1953
01:48:02,060 --> 01:48:02,920
1,100!

1954
01:48:03,060 --> 01:48:03,440
Ah!

1955
01:48:03,740 --> 01:48:04,340
Ah!

1956
01:48:04,720 --> 01:48:05,720
Ah!

1957
01:48:18,600 --> 01:48:18,900
Lee!

1958
01:48:19,520 --> 01:48:22,100
Haha, taking a break already?

1959
01:48:22,780 --> 01:48:23,780
Huh?

1960
01:48:31,640 --> 01:48:33,400
What is it, guy sensei?

1961
01:48:34,060 --> 01:48:39,680
If it is about my messing up on the last
assignment, I said I was sorry.

1962
01:48:42,400 --> 01:48:42,920
Lee!

1963
01:48:42,921 --> 01:48:45,360
It's true you are different from Neji and
the others.

1964
01:48:45,600 --> 01:48:50,040
You have no gift for ninjutsu or genjutsu,
and your taijutsu needs work.

1965
01:48:51,700 --> 01:48:55,800
But then again, you have a gift that Neji
doesn't have.

1966
01:48:56,580 --> 01:48:59,620
Not as flashy, but perhaps even more
important.

1967
01:48:59,960 --> 01:49:02,340
You do not have to make me feel better!

1968
01:49:03,020 --> 01:49:04,180
You idiot!

1969
01:49:04,540 --> 01:49:06,620
You think I'd waste my time with that?

1970
01:49:06,980 --> 01:49:10,676
No, all I'm saying is
that you have the gift of

1971
01:49:10,677 --> 01:49:14,200
perseverance, and that's
what makes you a genius too!

1972
01:49:17,760 --> 01:49:19,270
What is that true sensei?

1973
01:49:19,271 --> 01:49:22,690
I wonder...

1974
01:49:26,150 --> 01:49:27,890
I used to think so.

1975
01:49:28,170 --> 01:49:31,620
I used to believe that if I
just trained harder than Neji,

1976
01:49:31,621 --> 01:49:35,490
two or three times harder, I
would make myself strong enough.

1977
01:49:35,790 --> 01:49:38,370
But now, I am not so sure.

1978
01:49:38,810 --> 01:49:43,410
I do not know if I will ever be able to
work hard enough to beat real talent.

1979
01:49:45,710 --> 01:49:48,110
That is why I am always taking on Neji.

1980
01:49:49,270 --> 01:49:53,210
I keep thinking all of my efforts will pay
off, but it is always the same.

1981
01:49:54,430 --> 01:49:56,630
I am no match for him at all.

1982
01:49:57,190 --> 01:50:01,350
Every time we have a ninja mission,
my legs begin shaking.

1983
01:50:03,130 --> 01:50:05,430
I do not know if I can take it.

1984
01:50:05,705 --> 01:50:08,270
Sometimes it seems like the whole thing is
pointless.

1985
01:50:08,950 --> 01:50:12,130
Like I am a loser, and I will always be a
loser.

1986
01:50:14,460 --> 01:50:17,010
I do not know what to do.

1987
01:50:18,150 --> 01:50:19,210
You are right.

1988
01:50:19,290 --> 01:50:22,710
All the effort is pointless, if you do not
believe in yourself.

1989
01:50:27,770 --> 01:50:31,510
You know, Lee, we are a lot alike,
you and I.

1990
01:50:32,010 --> 01:50:33,110
You mean the eyebrows?

1991
01:50:34,170 --> 01:50:36,970
No, I do not mean our eyebrows.

1992
01:50:37,150 --> 01:50:39,910
You see, I was a loser too once.

1993
01:50:40,250 --> 01:50:40,510
What?

1994
01:50:40,670 --> 01:50:41,670
You were a loser?

1995
01:50:41,890 --> 01:50:43,030
Oh, yes indeed.

1996
01:50:43,270 --> 01:50:46,810
But I made myself the equal of any ninja,
even Kakashi.

1997
01:50:46,811 --> 01:50:49,230
And I did it through effort.

1998
01:50:49,590 --> 01:50:54,030
You say you want to show the world you can
be a splendid ninja, even if you do not

1999
01:50:54,031 --> 01:50:56,170
have all the gifts that others are blessed
with.

2000
01:50:56,570 --> 01:50:59,090
That is your nendo, your ninja way,
right?

2001
01:50:59,390 --> 01:51:01,370
Well, I think that is a fine goal.

2002
01:51:01,830 --> 01:51:05,230
As fine a goal as I have ever heard,
and one worth sticking to.

2003
01:51:08,310 --> 01:51:11,950
Do not let anything steer you off the path
you have drawn for yourself.

2004
01:51:12,290 --> 01:51:13,650
Forge ahead to the end.

2005
01:51:14,710 --> 01:51:16,030
Stick to it, Lee.

2006
01:51:16,170 --> 01:51:17,170
Make me proud.

2007
01:51:17,290 --> 01:51:18,850
Be everything you can be.

2008
01:51:19,930 --> 01:51:21,730
Will you do that for me, Lee?

2009
01:51:22,490 --> 01:51:23,490
Yes, sir!

2010
01:51:39,670 --> 01:51:42,210
Gai-sensei, thank you!

2011
01:51:44,510 --> 01:51:47,290
I will make you proud, sensei!

2012
01:51:47,550 --> 01:51:54,330
I will forge ahead, follow my path to the
end, and become the ninja I know I can be!

2013
01:51:55,930 --> 01:51:57,050
Lee's smiling!

2014
01:51:57,530 --> 01:52:00,130
He's running for his life, but he's still
smiling!

2015
01:52:00,610 --> 01:52:03,690
Yes, but now it's Gaara's turn to run.

2016
01:52:05,650 --> 01:52:08,890
The Leaf Village lotus blooms twice.

2017
01:52:09,310 --> 01:52:12,230
But... no, Gai, you didn't.

2018
01:52:12,231 --> 01:52:14,810
Yes, Kakashi, I did.

2019
01:52:15,130 --> 01:52:18,173
So that genin, that
boy, is able to open the

2020
01:52:18,174 --> 01:52:22,051
Eight Inner Gates and
use the Hidden Lotus?

2021
01:52:22,550 --> 01:52:23,550
That's correct.

2022
01:52:24,730 --> 01:52:27,590
Well, if that isn't the most...

2023
01:52:27,591 --> 01:52:31,170
Okay, what exactly are these Eight Inner
Gates you're talking about?

2024
01:52:31,290 --> 01:52:32,430
And the Hidden Lotus?

2025
01:52:33,610 --> 01:52:37,358
There are gates along the
chakra network, located at those

2026
01:52:37,359 --> 01:52:40,570
points in the body where the
chakra is most heavily concentrated.

2027
01:52:40,571 --> 01:52:45,670
Starting at the head, they are the gate of
opening, the gate of rest, of life,

2028
01:52:45,770 --> 01:52:50,430
of pain, of closing, of joy, of shock,
and the gate of death.

2029
01:52:50,770 --> 01:52:53,410
These are what are called the Eight Inner
Gates.

2030
01:52:53,890 --> 01:52:57,370
Their purpose is to limit the flow of
chakra through the body.

2031
01:52:57,570 --> 01:53:00,511
But the lotus exerts
tremendous pressure on these

2032
01:53:00,512 --> 01:53:03,611
limiters, eventually
forcing the gates open.

2033
01:53:07,060 --> 01:53:09,680
This releases the restraints on the
chakra.

2034
01:53:09,681 --> 01:53:15,240
The result being that a person's strength
can be increased tenfold, or more.

2035
01:53:16,260 --> 01:53:21,240
The Primary Lotus opens only the first
gate, the gate of opening.

2036
01:53:21,600 --> 01:53:22,240
Wait a minute.

2037
01:53:22,420 --> 01:53:25,020
Just the Primary Lotus almost destroyed
him.

2038
01:53:25,080 --> 01:53:26,080
He could barely move.

2039
01:53:26,160 --> 01:53:28,340
What's gonna happen to him if he takes it
farther?

2040
01:53:28,740 --> 01:53:29,740
Exactly.

2041
01:53:30,540 --> 01:53:35,520
By opening all Eight Gates, you could
attain power beyond even the Hokage's.

2042
01:53:35,850 --> 01:53:37,900
The only drawback is...

2043
01:53:39,680 --> 01:53:40,680
You'd die.

2044
01:53:42,400 --> 01:53:44,980
I don't know what this boy means to you,
guy.

2045
01:53:45,830 --> 01:53:50,781
But I shouldn't have to tell you that we
never bring our personal feelings into play.

2046
01:53:51,090 --> 01:53:53,180
I wouldn't have thought you were capable
of this.

2047
01:53:53,820 --> 01:53:55,200
You have no right.

2048
01:53:55,360 --> 01:53:56,640
You know nothing about him.

2049
01:53:56,840 --> 01:53:57,900
Nothing at all.

2050
01:53:58,380 --> 01:54:00,720
That boy has something important to prove.

2051
01:54:00,900 --> 01:54:04,440
And he's determined to prove it,
even at the cost of his life.

2052
01:54:08,660 --> 01:54:12,860
I am not going to be the only one to lose
here!

2053
01:54:13,180 --> 01:54:16,240
Guy-sensei, please let this work!

2054
01:54:16,480 --> 01:54:18,600
It is now or never!

2055
01:54:21,780 --> 01:54:24,720
He's opened the third gate, the gate of
life.

2056
01:54:24,880 --> 01:54:26,000
Now he'll attack.

2057
01:54:26,320 --> 01:54:28,100
Oh no, not yet.

2058
01:54:30,300 --> 01:54:31,900
The fourth gate!

2059
01:54:32,380 --> 01:54:33,640
Gate of Pain!

2060
01:54:34,440 --> 01:54:35,440
Open!

2061
01:54:46,670 --> 01:54:48,250
It's faster than ever.

2062
01:54:50,190 --> 01:54:50,910
Huh?

2063
01:54:51,110 --> 01:54:51,390
Whoa!

2064
01:54:51,570 --> 01:54:51,990
Got us!

2065
01:54:52,130 --> 01:54:53,490
Where'd they... go?

2066
01:54:54,150 --> 01:54:54,870
Huh?

2067
01:54:55,030 --> 01:54:56,030
Up there!

2068
01:55:08,070 --> 01:55:11,730
My armor... can't withstand this pounding!

2069
01:55:13,450 --> 01:55:15,130
You are a tough one!

2070
01:55:15,350 --> 01:55:16,350
You are a tough one!

2071
01:55:16,630 --> 01:55:17,710
Try this!

2072
01:55:22,080 --> 01:55:24,630
His muscles are tearing themselves apart!

2073
01:55:24,970 --> 01:55:26,270
Is that really Lee?

2074
01:55:26,490 --> 01:55:27,490
But when?

2075
01:55:27,710 --> 01:55:28,710
How?

2076
01:55:31,890 --> 01:55:34,150
One more and we are finished!

2077
01:55:34,670 --> 01:55:36,070
The fifth gate!

2078
01:55:36,330 --> 01:55:37,670
Gate of Closing!

2079
01:55:37,671 --> 01:55:38,671
Open!

2080
01:55:39,610 --> 01:55:42,150
No human could move like this!

2081
01:55:42,870 --> 01:55:44,750
Impossible to defend myself!

2082
01:55:44,751 --> 01:55:46,890
Are you watching, Neji?

2083
01:55:47,150 --> 01:55:50,170
Are we saving this ace in the hole to use
against you?

2084
01:55:50,830 --> 01:55:52,910
See what you have to look forward to?

2085
01:55:54,370 --> 01:55:55,370
Huh?

2086
01:55:55,730 --> 01:55:56,730
Huh?

2087
01:55:58,310 --> 01:55:59,310
No!

2088
01:56:01,650 --> 01:56:02,650
No!

2089
01:56:03,490 --> 01:56:03,510
No!

2090
01:56:03,670 --> 01:56:03,810
No!

2091
01:56:03,811 --> 01:56:03,990
No!

2092
01:56:04,650 --> 01:56:05,650
No!

2093
01:56:06,350 --> 01:56:07,350
No!

2094
01:56:07,710 --> 01:56:08,710
The shield can't keep up!

2095
01:56:11,110 --> 01:56:12,270
He's in trouble!

2096
01:56:13,170 --> 01:56:14,490
It is loaded!

2097
01:56:24,100 --> 01:56:25,300
So fast!

2098
01:56:25,600 --> 01:56:26,840
I couldn't see a thing!

2099
01:56:32,600 --> 01:56:33,600
Unbelievable!

2100
01:56:33,820 --> 01:56:34,520
He did it!

2101
01:56:34,740 --> 01:56:35,740
Kana!

2102
01:56:36,260 --> 01:56:37,260
Is it over?

2103
01:56:42,000 --> 01:56:43,000
Huh?

2104
01:56:43,100 --> 01:56:44,100
What's that?

2105
01:56:44,260 --> 01:56:45,260
Down there!

2106
01:56:53,440 --> 01:56:54,200
Unbelievable!

2107
01:56:54,201 --> 01:56:57,300
He cushioned his fall by turning that
gourd into sand!

2108
01:57:14,770 --> 01:57:15,350
Impossible!

2109
01:57:15,650 --> 01:57:20,350
He not only survived the hidden lotus,
he is able to go on the attack!

2110
01:57:29,650 --> 01:57:30,810
Sand coffin!

2111
01:57:30,811 --> 01:57:31,811
You have been...

2112
01:57:33,110 --> 01:57:34,510
NOOOOOOO!

2113
01:57:41,490 --> 01:57:44,750
Now you die!

2114
01:57:59,570 --> 01:58:02,370
But why?

2115
01:58:02,900 --> 01:58:04,130
He failed!

2116
01:58:05,710 --> 01:58:07,470
Why he did that?

2117
01:58:07,471 --> 01:58:08,471
Save him!

2118
01:58:11,010 --> 01:58:12,010
Because he's...

2119
01:58:13,750 --> 01:58:14,750
He's my student.

2120
01:58:15,430 --> 01:58:17,470
And also because he is precious to me.

2121
01:58:20,300 --> 01:58:23,630
That's a sentiment that Gaara couldn't
even begin to understand.

2122
01:58:30,550 --> 01:58:31,910
I quit.

2123
01:58:40,270 --> 01:58:41,270
Huh?

2124
01:58:51,260 --> 01:58:52,540
It can't be.

2125
01:59:05,320 --> 01:59:11,160
After all that, he shouldn't be able to
move, let alone stand up.

2126
01:59:14,080 --> 01:59:15,080
No, Lee.

2127
01:59:15,200 --> 01:59:16,200
It's alright.

2128
01:59:16,440 --> 01:59:17,740
It's all over now.

2129
01:59:17,980 --> 01:59:19,940
Anyway, you're in no condition to...

2130
01:59:24,330 --> 01:59:25,330
Lee...

2131
01:59:26,820 --> 01:59:27,820
Oh, Lee...

2132
01:59:29,780 --> 01:59:31,050
What have I done?

2133
01:59:36,480 --> 01:59:38,000
He's out cold.

2134
01:59:38,480 --> 01:59:41,440
Nothing keeping him up but sheer
willpower.

2135
01:59:47,020 --> 01:59:49,300
You are a splendid ninja.

2136
01:59:53,970 --> 01:59:56,400
The winner is Gaara.

2137
02:00:00,840 --> 02:00:01,840
Right?

2138
02:00:14,540 --> 02:00:20,740
... I can't believe it...

2139
02:00:21,180 --> 02:00:22,740
Lee lost to him?!

2140
02:00:24,820 --> 02:00:25,540
Hurry!

2141
02:00:25,720 --> 02:00:26,720
This boy needs attention.

2142
02:00:40,380 --> 02:00:42,180
You're his teacher, aren't you?

2143
02:00:43,740 --> 02:00:44,740
I am.

2144
02:00:44,820 --> 02:00:45,820
What is it?

2145
02:00:46,260 --> 02:00:48,020
Will you come with me?

2146
02:00:52,830 --> 02:00:53,830
Careful with him.

2147
02:00:55,430 --> 02:00:56,430
That's right, easy.

2148
02:00:59,525 --> 02:01:02,550
The boy's breathing is faint, but steady.

2149
02:01:04,510 --> 02:01:07,330
There are bone fractures and muscle tears
throughout his body.

2150
02:01:08,660 --> 02:01:11,290
He's facing a long and difficult
rehabilitation.

2151
02:01:11,291 --> 02:01:15,010
But I'm afraid that's not the worst of it.

2152
02:01:16,510 --> 02:01:20,470
His left arm and leg in particular have
suffered massive damage.

2153
02:01:21,580 --> 02:01:23,950
I'm sorry, I know how much it means to you
both.

2154
02:01:24,810 --> 02:01:26,030
But he'll never fight again.

2155
02:01:26,250 --> 02:01:28,610
His days as a shinobi are over.

2156
02:01:40,460 --> 02:01:41,460
Lee...

2157
02:01:42,300 --> 02:01:43,660
Oh, forgive me.

2158
02:01:44,720 --> 02:01:46,860
I couldn't bear the thought of you losing.

2159
02:01:48,160 --> 02:01:49,780
It was all my fault.

2160
02:01:50,280 --> 02:01:51,920
I should have stopped it.

2161
02:01:52,940 --> 02:01:53,940
Forgive me.

2162
02:01:54,820 --> 02:01:55,820
Lee!

2163
02:01:57,760 --> 02:01:58,900
It's not true.

2164
02:02:00,260 --> 02:02:01,580
It can't be true.

2165
02:02:02,320 --> 02:02:03,900
Easy for you to say it's over.

2166
02:02:04,040 --> 02:02:05,120
What about Bushy Brow?

2167
02:02:05,240 --> 02:02:06,600
What's he supposed to do now?

2168
02:02:08,340 --> 02:02:08,820
Failure?

2169
02:02:09,340 --> 02:02:11,120
I thought you said we could win.

2170
02:02:11,320 --> 02:02:13,880
I thought you were going to show how a
failure can win.

2171
02:02:13,881 --> 02:02:15,460
That's enough, Naruto.

2172
02:02:17,140 --> 02:02:19,400
But Sensei, it isn't fair.

2173
02:02:19,620 --> 02:02:23,960
All he ever wanted was to prove himself
against Sasuke and Neji.

2174
02:02:24,240 --> 02:02:27,040
And maybe that's what led to his downfall.

2175
02:02:29,140 --> 02:02:31,600
But you're wrong about one thing,
Naruto.

2176
02:02:32,000 --> 02:02:35,280
It wasn't just Sasuke and Neji he was
thinking of.

2177
02:02:35,420 --> 02:02:36,660
It was you too.

2178
02:02:38,660 --> 02:02:39,180
That's right.

2179
02:02:39,660 --> 02:02:43,440
He risked everything just for the hope of
meeting you in combat.

2180
02:02:43,441 --> 02:02:44,960
Remember that.

2181
02:02:50,000 --> 02:02:51,620
Be worthy of his sacrifice.

2182
02:02:52,580 --> 02:02:55,192
Fate will never smile
on the fortunes of a ninja

2183
02:02:55,193 --> 02:02:58,361
who seeks victory by
falling on his own sword.

2184
02:02:59,195 --> 02:03:01,000
Or demanding that others fall on theirs.

2185
02:03:08,400 --> 02:03:11,220
So, the worst didn't happen after all.

2186
02:03:12,510 --> 02:03:14,440
Good to have you back, Gaara.

2187
02:03:23,250 --> 02:03:24,250
Gai.

2188
02:03:25,400 --> 02:03:27,930
What I said earlier, it was out of line.

2189
02:03:29,040 --> 02:03:30,730
I was being a self-righteous fool.

2190
02:03:31,845 --> 02:03:34,901
I realize now that if
I'd been in your shoes,

2191
02:03:34,902 --> 02:03:38,211
I probably couldn't
have stopped him either.

2192
02:03:43,260 --> 02:03:44,260
Come on, Gai.

2193
02:03:44,570 --> 02:03:45,570
Let's go up.

2194
02:03:46,540 --> 02:03:49,030
They can't start the next match with us
standing here.

2195
02:03:52,260 --> 02:03:53,260
Right.

2196
02:03:57,390 --> 02:03:59,520
Now then, the last two competitors.

2197
02:04:00,340 --> 02:04:01,680
Will you please step forward?

2198
02:04:04,420 --> 02:04:07,140
So, it's finally my turn.

2199
02:04:08,925 --> 02:04:11,680
Just keep your eyes on the prize.

2200
02:04:12,120 --> 02:04:13,780
All-you-can-eat barbecue.

2201
02:04:14,300 --> 02:04:18,680
My job is to survive the main tournament
and battle Sasuke.

2202
02:04:18,800 --> 02:04:21,320
Isn't that right, Lord Orochimaru?

2203
02:04:22,220 --> 02:04:24,220
I wouldn't want to disappoint you.

2204
02:04:26,020 --> 02:04:28,220
I begin to see through your design.

2205
02:04:28,620 --> 02:04:33,120
The reason you set us against Sasuke,
but forbid us from killing him.

2206
02:04:33,540 --> 02:04:35,260
The curse you put on him.

2207
02:04:35,900 --> 02:04:38,540
We were your pawns, weren't we,
my lord?

2208
02:04:39,020 --> 02:04:42,220
Put here merely to test the limits of his
abilities.

2209
02:04:42,760 --> 02:04:44,940
It's not Sasuke's life you want.

2210
02:04:45,260 --> 02:04:47,140
It's Sasuke himself.

2211
02:04:48,760 --> 02:04:51,200
You played us all for fools.

2212
02:04:51,300 --> 02:04:52,300
Even me.

2213
02:04:53,860 --> 02:04:54,860
All right.

2214
02:04:55,360 --> 02:04:57,160
The tenth and final match.

2215
02:04:57,680 --> 02:04:58,680
Begin.

2216
02:04:58,960 --> 02:05:00,020
You can do it!

2217
02:05:00,560 --> 02:05:01,560
Fatso!

2218
02:05:04,220 --> 02:05:04,800
Okay!

2219
02:05:05,120 --> 02:05:06,820
I'm gonna finish this match!

2220
02:05:07,040 --> 02:05:09,020
It's only gonna take about two seconds!

2221
02:05:09,200 --> 02:05:11,160
And then I'm coming after you,
Eno!

2222
02:05:12,100 --> 02:05:13,160
Fine, Fatso.

2223
02:05:13,240 --> 02:05:16,800
If you want this match to end quickly,
I'll just win it quickly.

2224
02:05:18,320 --> 02:05:21,500
You're gonna go down hard, you mummified
weirdo!

2225
02:05:21,900 --> 02:05:23,240
Ninja Arts!

2226
02:05:23,580 --> 02:05:24,840
Expansion Jutsu!

2227
02:05:25,440 --> 02:05:27,740
Now the Hidden Leaf Style Taijutsu!

2228
02:05:31,680 --> 02:05:34,380
This will protect my ears from his
attacks!

2229
02:05:34,640 --> 02:05:36,580
And crush him like a bug!

2230
02:05:37,220 --> 02:05:38,320
Human Boulder!

2231
02:05:39,020 --> 02:05:40,020
Chubby's Rule!

2232
02:05:40,780 --> 02:05:41,780
Yeah!

2233
02:05:41,920 --> 02:05:42,120
Yeah!

2234
02:05:42,260 --> 02:05:42,440
Yeah!

2235
02:05:42,880 --> 02:05:42,960
Yeah!

2236
02:05:43,300 --> 02:05:43,980
Yeah!

2237
02:05:43,981 --> 02:05:47,320
He barely has any control over where he's
going!

2238
02:05:48,000 --> 02:05:49,760
Now to end this!

2239
02:05:50,520 --> 02:05:51,780
It's no use!

2240
02:05:51,820 --> 02:05:52,880
My ears are covered!

2241
02:05:53,220 --> 02:05:54,660
You're so wrong.

2242
02:05:57,600 --> 02:05:58,600
Uwaaaaaah!

2243
02:06:05,160 --> 02:06:10,900
See, the human body is 70% water,
and water can transmit sound waves.

2244
02:06:11,180 --> 02:06:12,240
In other words...

2245
02:06:12,241 --> 02:06:16,900
When it comes to my attacks, your whole
body is basically one big ear.

2246
02:06:20,860 --> 02:06:23,190
The winner is... Dosukinuta.

2247
02:06:26,230 --> 02:06:27,630
Lord Orochimaru.

2248
02:06:28,380 --> 02:06:30,310
Or rather, Orochimaru.

2249
02:06:30,590 --> 02:06:31,890
Now do you see?

2250
02:06:32,650 --> 02:06:34,650
I'm more than a mere puppet.

2251
02:06:36,565 --> 02:06:38,030
Hey, are you alright?

2252
02:06:38,670 --> 02:06:39,270
Meat.

2253
02:06:39,540 --> 02:06:40,590
I wanna eat some meat.

2254
02:06:40,770 --> 02:06:41,810
That's our Choji.

2255
02:06:42,030 --> 02:06:43,690
Always thinking with his stomach.

2256
02:06:44,090 --> 02:06:48,010
Even though he lost, the least we can do
is take him out for some barbecue beef.

2257
02:06:50,730 --> 02:06:51,990
It's finally over.

2258
02:06:52,610 --> 02:06:55,610
At long last, we can begin the final
rounds.

2259
02:06:56,710 --> 02:07:01,250
And with that match, the third exam
preliminaries are now finished.

2260
02:07:15,770 --> 02:07:21,890
Вы на моего солнца.

2261
02:07:21,891 --> 02:07:22,891
I can't believe it...

2262
02:07:23,950 --> 02:07:24,750
I didn't know you were such a precious
student.

2263
02:07:24,830 --> 02:07:25,630
I'll be very grateful if I have to say
this much in the future.

2264
02:07:25,631 --> 02:07:29,610
You, too, as well.

2265
02:07:29,850 --> 02:07:31,170
I'm extremely grateful that you've become
an awesome student.

2266
02:07:31,171 --> 02:07:32,646
I think I'm the best student I've ever
met.

2267
02:07:32,670 --> 02:07:33,786
And I'm always thankful for John.

2268
02:07:33,810 --> 02:07:34,610
And for all the people in the world.

2269
02:07:34,611 --> 02:07:38,610
And after all this happening, I'd like to
say one thing to my friends and family.

2270
02:07:38,670 --> 02:07:43,290
If you are a great student, please give
the best of yourself to everyone.

2271
02:07:43,291 --> 02:07:44,291
See you soon.

2272
02:07:44,350 --> 02:07:52,350
It's okay now, because everyone is in the
middle of my hand.

2273
02:07:56,510 --> 02:08:00,690
I want to cry, I want to run away.

2274
02:08:01,670 --> 02:08:07,790
If I forget my happiness, I'll sing a
song.

2275
02:08:09,630 --> 02:08:15,210
The light is born, the darkness is born.

2276
02:08:15,430 --> 02:08:17,250
Two are one.

2277
02:08:18,230 --> 02:08:19,350
Harmonia.

2278
02:08:20,450 --> 02:08:21,570
Penetration.

2279
02:08:24,690 --> 02:08:27,230
Hey, can you hear me?

